(825634, 92972, 2780, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but I''m not sure what the grey bit at the bottom is. I think I would have preferred it with just a black background.</td>', 'Nice shot, but I''m not sure what the grey bit at the bottom is. I think I would have preferred it with just a black background.', '2004-07-26 07:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
