(825782, 92861, 2780, '<td valign="top">Is that supposed to say Silent Scream? Anyway, nice photo. The DoF works well. I would have boosted the contrast a little tho to stop it looking as flat.</td>', 'Is that supposed to say Silent Scream? Anyway, nice photo. The DoF works well. I would have boosted the contrast a little tho to stop it looking as flat.', '2004-07-26 09:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(825783, 93474, 2780, '<td valign="top">I like the way everything matches the red tone, and the PoV is good.</td>', 'I like the way everything matches the red tone, and the PoV is good.', '2004-07-26 09:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(825785, 93269, 2780, '<td valign="top">Great portrait. The B&amp;W work is excellent.</td>', 'Great portrait. The B&W work is excellent.', '2004-07-26 09:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(825788, 93576, 2780, '<td valign="top">The text should be anti-aliased imo, so it doesn''t have the jagged edges. That would make it look better. The photo is great :)</td>', 'The text should be anti-aliased imo, so it doesn''t have the jagged edges. That would make it look better. The photo is great :)', '2004-07-26 09:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(825789, 92846, 23456, '<td valign="top">One of my favourites. Eye catching !</td>', 'One of my favourites. Eye catching !', '2004-07-26 09:18:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(825790, 93109, 2780, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. It seems a bit soft tho. Try applying a slight USM to sharpen it up a bit.</td>', 'Nice shot. It seems a bit soft tho. Try applying a slight USM to sharpen it up a bit.', '2004-07-26 09:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(825792, 92727, 2780, '<td valign="top">I don''t really like the border effect, and the overall image is a bit small for me to be able to see the details properly. Try to use the full 640 pixel limit.</td>', 'I don''t really like the border effect, and the overall image is a bit small for me to be able to see the details properly. Try to use the full 640 pixel limit.', '2004-07-26 09:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(825793, 93529, 2780, '<td valign="top">Good shot. For some reason, the back wheel of the right bike is pretty out of focus even tho the rest of the shot isnt. I think thats a bit of a distraction.</td>', 'Good shot. For some reason, the back wheel of the right bike is pretty out of focus even tho the rest of the shot isnt. I think thats a bit of a distraction.', '2004-07-26 09:20:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(825795, 93521, 2780, '<td valign="top">Cute dog :) He looks funny with those eyes, almost like a cartoon :)</td>', 'Cute dog :) He looks funny with those eyes, almost like a cartoon :)', '2004-07-26 09:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(825797, 93311, 2780, '<td valign="top">Yum, looks tasty :)</td>', 'Yum, looks tasty :)', '2004-07-26 09:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(825798, 92915, 2780, '<td valign="top">Great macro shot. 9</td>', 'Great macro shot. 9', '2004-07-26 09:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(825799, 93435, 2780, '<td valign="top">Did you squash this into the square ratio rather than cropping? They all look a bit squashed, which distracts from the photo imo. Also, adding a bit of contrast in post processing will help being out the nice yellow colours more.</td>', 'Did you squash this into the square ratio rather than cropping? They all look a bit squashed, which distracts from the photo imo. Also, adding a bit of contrast in post processing will help being out the nice yellow colours more.', '2004-07-26 09:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(825801, 93033, 2780, '<td valign="top">Nice shot :) Did you add the text in photoshop or is it dome with painting with light? Not that it matter, it looks good either way :)</td>', 'Nice shot :) Did you add the text in photoshop or is it dome with painting with light? Not that it matter, it looks good either way :)', '2004-07-26 09:23:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(825802, 92617, 2780, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. The guy in the background works well. I would have used a thin black line around the text to make it stand out a bit more from the photo though. Also, a bit of contrast added (or dodge/burn) would make the B&amp;W work better.</td>', 'Nice shot. The guy in the background works well. I would have used a thin black line around the text to make it stand out a bit more from the photo though. Also, a bit of contrast added (or dodge/burn) would make the B&W work better.', '2004-07-26 09:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
