(825805, 93421, 2780, '<td valign="top">The photo looks a bit soft. USM could sort that out. Also the text kinda gets lost in the photo. Try adding a black outline to it, and maybe a dmall drop shadow too.</td>', 'The photo looks a bit soft. USM could sort that out. Also the text kinda gets lost in the photo. Try adding a black outline to it, and maybe a dmall drop shadow too.', '2004-07-26 09:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(825806, 93606, 2780, '<td valign="top">This is a really cool shot. A little bit of extra contrast or dodge/burn would make it one of the best in the challenge, but at the moment I think it looks a little flat.</td>', 'This is a really cool shot. A little bit of extra contrast or dodge/burn would make it one of the best in the challenge, but at the moment I think it looks a little flat.', '2004-07-26 09:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
