(825949, 93506, 2612, '<td valign="top">Almost perfect! If you could have frozen the motion for at least her head this would have been an 11 and one of my all time DPC favorites. It''s good... but I''m frustrated because it was so close to amazing....</td>', 'Almost perfect! If you could have frozen the motion for at least her head this would have been an 11 and one of my all time DPC favorites. It''s good... but I''m frustrated because it was so close to amazing....', '2004-07-26 11:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
