(825960, 93580, 2612, '<td valign="top">Fantastic concept!!! I don''t know that I would be overwhelmed with the photo as a standalone piece of work, but it is perfect for drawing attention to the album and supporting the title. Your creativity on the title is what puts this over the top.... you managed to connect DPC back to one of the more interesting themes from the site.</td>', 'Fantastic concept!!! I don''t know that I would be overwhelmed with the photo as a standalone piece of work, but it is perfect for drawing attention to the album and supporting the title. Your creativity on the title is what puts this over the top.... you managed to connect DPC back to one of the more interesting themes from the site.', '2004-07-26 11:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
