(825996, 93465, 18349, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photograph of the dunes...lighting works well.  Love the album title...wish there was a little moon in the shot, but that''s just me.   Great job!  :o)</td>', 'Beautiful photograph of the dunes...lighting works well.  Love the album title...wish there was a little moon in the shot, but that''s just me.   Great job!  :o)', '2004-07-26 12:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
