(826156, 93573, 22392, '<td valign="top">It''s a beautiful picture. I guess you will get low votes because you didn''t make it square and added the bandname. Well, I imagend two black blocks on either side of the picture to make it square, and think it''s an impressive album cover then. So 8 from me.</td>', 'It''s a beautiful picture. I guess you will get low votes because you didn''t make it square and added the bandname. Well, I imagend two black blocks on either side of the picture to make it square, and think it''s an impressive album cover then. So 8 from me.', '2004-07-26 13:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
