(826191, 93011, 7322, '<td valign="top">Good band name and nice, simple, graphic layout.</td>', 'Good band name and nice, simple, graphic layout.', '2004-07-26 14:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(826193, 93437, 7322, '<td valign="top">Ech! The band name has the cheesy ring of current so-called alternative. Which means it works! The cover is kind of boring. The layout is good.</td>', 'Ech! The band name has the cheesy ring of current so-called alternative. Which means it works! The cover is kind of boring. The layout is good.', '2004-07-26 14:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(826196, 93314, 7322, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t have the feel of a band name to me. The Deep Purple thing isn''t too imaginative. Nor does the photo look like authentic cover art. The photo is technically good. I''m pretty tired of seeing eye macros on DPC.</td>', 'This doesn''t have the feel of a band name to me. The Deep Purple thing isn''t too imaginative. Nor does the photo look like authentic cover art. The photo is technically good. I''m pretty tired of seeing eye macros on DPC.', '2004-07-26 14:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(826198, 93177, 7322, '<td valign="top">Another Deep Purple name. Kind of boring. The photo is well-done and interesting. Text would help convince me this was ''authentic'' cover art.</td>', 'Another Deep Purple name. Kind of boring. The photo is well-done and interesting. Text would help convince me this was ''authentic'' cover art.', '2004-07-26 14:09:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(826201, 93127, 7322, '<td valign="top">I''m not crazy about the band name. The cows look pretty healthy. They don''t seem to mind that they''ve been Photoshopped. ;-D I''m not nuts about the weird orange sky. It kind of shouts out that the cows have been altered according to DPC rules (in other words--the whole image). Text would help convince me.</td>', 'I''m not crazy about the band name. The cows look pretty healthy. They don''t seem to mind that they''ve been Photoshopped. ;-D I''m not nuts about the weird orange sky. It kind of shouts out that the cows have been altered according to DPC rules (in other words--the whole image). Text would help convince me.', '2004-07-26 14:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(826207, 93251, 7322, '<td valign="top">The band name is interesting. I don''t really see how this photo fits. It certainly doesn''t fit if these kids are the band. It seems to esoteric and fey to be a name created by two boys in casual sports attire. The text has an amateurish quality to it. Meaning, too much filtering, IMO.  One wouldn''t really see this done on actual cover art. This really just doesn''t work for me.</td>', 'The band name is interesting. I don''t really see how this photo fits. It certainly doesn''t fit if these kids are the band. It seems to esoteric and fey to be a name created by two boys in casual sports attire. The text has an amateurish quality to it. Meaning, too much filtering, IMO.  One wouldn''t really see this done on actual cover art. This really just doesn''t work for me.', '2004-07-26 14:15:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(826209, 93502, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is kind of boring for cover art but I guess it fits the name of the band.</td>', 'This is kind of boring for cover art but I guess it fits the name of the band.', '2004-07-26 14:15:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(826215, 93595, 7322, '<td valign="top">I really don''t like the band name. It sounds very awkward. Maybe Deeply Pierced Cut would have worked a little better? The text looks over Photoshopped to be authentic. The photo works well, although the glowing edge of the blade against the skin looks strange.</td>', 'I really don''t like the band name. It sounds very awkward. Maybe Deeply Pierced Cut would have worked a little better? The text looks over Photoshopped to be authentic. The photo works well, although the glowing edge of the blade against the skin looks strange.', '2004-07-26 14:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(826223, 93614, 7322, '<td valign="top">The pose and feathered headdress work really well as ''vintage'' album art. The model looks a bit too tired  to be really authentic for this idea. The soft focus helps but I can still see the bags under her eyes and the lines in her lips.  More dramtic eye make-up would brighten things up. Overall, well done.</td>', 'The pose and feathered headdress work really well as ''vintage'' album art. The model looks a bit too tired  to be really authentic for this idea. The soft focus helps but I can still see the bags under her eyes and the lines in her lips.  More dramtic eye make-up would brighten things up. Overall, well done.', '2004-07-26 14:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(826224, 93429, 7322, '<td valign="top">Good photo and the band name works well. A little boring for cover art but it feels authentic.</td>', 'Good photo and the band name works well. A little boring for cover art but it feels authentic.', '2004-07-26 14:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(826229, 92986, 7322, '<td valign="top">A bit overwhelming. There''s a lot going on here with the huge font at the top and the vertically aligned text at the side. The person peeking out from behind the headstone is almost unnoticible at first. The guitar has a squashed, distorted appearance. I think a smaller font and different placement would make this less cluttered looking.</td>', 'A bit overwhelming. There''s a lot going on here with the huge font at the top and the vertically aligned text at the side. The person peeking out from behind the headstone is almost unnoticible at first. The guitar has a squashed, distorted appearance. I think a smaller font and different placement would make this less cluttered looking.', '2004-07-26 14:25:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(826230, 93590, 16230, '<td valign="top">I had the same idea for the name, but no plastic creature. Good job!</td>', 'I had the same idea for the name, but no plastic creature. Good job!', '2004-07-26 14:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(826234, 92847, 16230, '<td valign="top">Love the eyes! The background is a bit...blah.<br/></td>', 'Love the eyes! The background is a bit...blah.', '2004-07-26 14:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(826243, 93435, 12448, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of an album cover from the late 60''s, early 70''s.  All the writing is really distracting to me, it''s more like the back of the album than the front.  Usually when songs are listed on the front they are on a sticker on the plastic cover so the picture and cover is untouched.<br/> <br/>A nice shot overall, a bit busy with so many flowers.  And it comes off just a bit dull for some reason, maybe it''s the lettering color that throwing me off.<br/> <br/>As is a 5</td>', 'This reminds me of an album cover from the late 60''s, early 70''s.  All the writing is really distracting to me, it''s more like the back of the album than the front.  Usually when songs are listed on the front they are on a sticker on the plastic cover so the picture and cover is untouched. A nice shot overall, a bit busy with so many flowers.  And it comes off just a bit dull for some reason, maybe it''s the lettering color that throwing me off. As is a 5', '2004-07-26 14:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(826250, 93137, 12448, '<td valign="top">Haha, I love this.  It reminds me of the old lounge records, Frank Sinatra, Dean Martin type records.  The dogs are adorable but seems a bit bright on the one on the left.  Just a tad blown out.  I like the title of the band but the lettering is overpowering to me.  Smaller size font that went all the way across the top, with the Size Doesn''t Matter right under it to the left, I think would have worked better.  As is a 7</td>', 'Haha, I love this.  It reminds me of the old lounge records, Frank Sinatra, Dean Martin type records.  The dogs are adorable but seems a bit bright on the one on the left.  Just a tad blown out.  I like the title of the band but the lettering is overpowering to me.  Smaller size font that went all the way across the top, with the Size Doesn''t Matter right under it to the left, I think would have worked better.  As is a 7', '2004-07-26 14:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(826264, 92861, 12448, '<td valign="top">Interesting title and interesing shot. I think if the lettering wasn''t there or if it was smaller, leaving more negative space on the cover I would like this much more. <br/> <br/>As is a 7</td>', 'Interesting title and interesing shot. I think if the lettering wasn''t there or if it was smaller, leaving more negative space on the cover I would like this much more.  As is a 7', '2004-07-26 14:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(826265, 93569, 12448, '<td valign="top">I love this!  I don''t know how, where or what, but I love this!  Are these cars actually buried in the hill side?  If not, you did an excellent post processing job.  The title is perfect for this.  The only thing I would chance is to bring the lighting down just a notch, just a tad bright.  An 8</td>', 'I love this!  I don''t know how, where or what, but I love this!  Are these cars actually buried in the hill side?  If not, you did an excellent post processing job.  The title is perfect for this.  The only thing I would chance is to bring the lighting down just a notch, just a tad bright.  An 8', '2004-07-26 14:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(826269, 93567, 12448, '<td valign="top">Not really sure what you are going for here but here''s my comments.  First, I have no idea what the title is with the exception of the piggybank and even then, I see no piggybank reference in the shot.  Maybe I''m being to literal.<br/> <br/>Second the shot seems very cluttered and busy.  All the patterns on the materials competeing for my attention makes me look all over the place and ends up being confusing.  The candles add nothing to the shot for me and the flash or light on the jigsaw ball in the upper left is also distracting.  A 4</td>', 'Not really sure what you are going for here but here''s my comments.  First, I have no idea what the title is with the exception of the piggybank and even then, I see no piggybank reference in the shot.  Maybe I''m being to literal. Second the shot seems very cluttered and busy.  All the patterns on the materials competeing for my attention makes me look all over the place and ends up being confusing.  The candles add nothing to the shot for me and the flash or light on the jigsaw ball in the upper left is also distracting.  A 4', '2004-07-26 14:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(826271, 93420, 12448, '<td valign="top">Hum, not sure it''s the pussy cats who are so dumb when they aren''t the ones filling the bowls! :)<br/> <br/>Not a bad shot, the sun reflection on the liquid bow is a nice little touch but I''m not sure if that''s supposed to be pop or coffee?<br/> <br/>Clean, crisp, nice use of negative space though the lettering is a bit large to me, maybe bring the size of the font down one or two notches.  As is an 8</td>', 'Hum, not sure it''s the pussy cats who are so dumb when they aren''t the ones filling the bowls! :) Not a bad shot, the sun reflection on the liquid bow is a nice little touch but I''m not sure if that''s supposed to be pop or coffee? Clean, crisp, nice use of negative space though the lettering is a bit large to me, maybe bring the size of the font down one or two notches.  As is an 8', '2004-07-26 14:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(826273, 93476, 12448, '<td valign="top">I love this.  This is so modern, so today, so perfect.  Simple, clean and the lettering size and placement is perfect.  A 10</td>', 'I love this.  This is so modern, so today, so perfect.  Simple, clean and the lettering size and placement is perfect.  A 10', '2004-07-26 14:58:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(826274, 93434, 12448, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I like the fact that you didn''t feel the need to spell out the entire name of the band, good choice of font and colors.<br/> <br/>The stark white backdrop is perfect for this shot but the faces are just a little overexposed, almost matching the background, making them look transparent.  If the were closer to the color of the hand this would be a perfect shot.  A 9</td>', 'Very nice.  I like the fact that you didn''t feel the need to spell out the entire name of the band, good choice of font and colors. The stark white backdrop is perfect for this shot but the faces are just a little overexposed, almost matching the background, making them look transparent.  If the were closer to the color of the hand this would be a perfect shot.  A 9', '2004-07-26 15:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(826278, 93099, 12448, '<td valign="top">Interesting title and very interesting shot.  I like the shot, I really do but the lettering on the title really pulls me away.  The way it''s smeared or smudged in all directions is really distracting to me.  I used to make signs that had the swept or smudged look and one thing I found that really works for me is to keep it all going in the same direction, making it look more wind swept than smudged.<br/> <br/>The lighting is a bit harsh in just a couple of spots but otherwise a nice shot.  As is an 8</td>', 'Interesting title and very interesting shot.  I like the shot, I really do but the lettering on the title really pulls me away.  The way it''s smeared or smudged in all directions is really distracting to me.  I used to make signs that had the swept or smudged look and one thing I found that really works for me is to keep it all going in the same direction, making it look more wind swept than smudged. The lighting is a bit harsh in just a couple of spots but otherwise a nice shot.  As is an 8', '2004-07-26 15:02:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(826279, 93502, 12448, '<td valign="top">Hello 70''s! :)  This is so reminisant of an album cover from the 70''s and I should know! ;)<br/> <br/>Nice shot, decent coloration but nothing to really make me want to pick it up off the shelf.  Just lacking that "pop" factor that would make it stand out.  A 6</td>', 'Hello 70''s! :)  This is so reminisant of an album cover from the 70''s and I should know! ;) Nice shot, decent coloration but nothing to really make me want to pick it up off the shelf.  Just lacking that "pop" factor that would make it stand out.  A 6', '2004-07-26 15:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(826283, 93443, 6845, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot. I could definitely see it used as and album cover. The only thing that I personally would chage is the placement of the "divine paradise club". Being that it is over a busy area of the image, it sort of gets lost.  I would like to see the name down in the lower left-hand corner ormaybe just above their heads.  Anyway, good shot.</td>', 'I really like this shot. I could definitely see it used as and album cover. The only thing that I personally would chage is the placement of the "divine paradise club". Being that it is over a busy area of the image, it sort of gets lost.  I would like to see the name down in the lower left-hand corner ormaybe just above their heads.  Anyway, good shot.', '2004-07-26 15:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(826284, 93542, 12448, '<td valign="top">Another reminder of the 70''s album covers :)<br/> <br/>There seems to be a lot of them in this challenge.<br/> <br/>I like the moon shot but I think I would have liked a black background more than the blue or purple that you were going for?  I like the contrast of the pink on black, would have jumped out more to me and made me look twice and think about picking it up.<br/> <br/>A 6</td>', 'Another reminder of the 70''s album covers :) There seems to be a lot of them in this challenge. I like the moon shot but I think I would have liked a black background more than the blue or purple that you were going for?  I like the contrast of the pink on black, would have jumped out more to me and made me look twice and think about picking it up. A 6', '2004-07-26 15:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(826285, 93210, 12448, '<td valign="top">Oh my!  SOmeone had some fun!  I love this, wouldn''t change a thing!  A 10</td>', 'Oh my!  SOmeone had some fun!  I love this, wouldn''t change a thing!  A 10', '2004-07-26 15:10:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(826287, 93472, 12448, '<td valign="top">Okay, where''s the beef?  I can''t even see the burger part, I know, being literal but the main part of the shot is the tomato.  The lettering is good but a bit big to me.  And the purple is okay but not a lot of contrast, nothing to make it jump out at me on the shelf.  A 7</td>', 'Okay, where''s the beef?  I can''t even see the burger part, I know, being literal but the main part of the shot is the tomato.  The lettering is good but a bit big to me.  And the purple is okay but not a lot of contrast, nothing to make it jump out at me on the shelf.  A 7', '2004-07-26 15:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(826288, 92727, 12448, '<td valign="top">This has great potential to grab my attention but it''s just shy of it.  The size in one thing, it seems a bit small.  And that makes me miss some of the details of the covor.  Also the crisp lines coming in and out of the upper right and lower left corner are a nice touch but then the rest is so soft and undefined it leaves me a bit off balance.  <br/> <br/>As is a 6</td>', 'This has great potential to grab my attention but it''s just shy of it.  The size in one thing, it seems a bit small.  And that makes me miss some of the details of the covor.  Also the crisp lines coming in and out of the upper right and lower left corner are a nice touch but then the rest is so soft and undefined it leaves me a bit off balance.   As is a 6', '2004-07-26 15:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(826290, 93137, 9780, '<td valign="top">Love it. Make me smile. 9</td>', 'Love it. Make me smile. 9', '2004-07-26 15:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(826304, 93476, 16004, '<td valign="top">this is so werid - you two guys look almost exactly like superb band Lamb.  this so very fits the challenge!  i''m not greatly keen on the font - something a bit less, erm, scruffy (?) might suit a little better - something like the one i''m typing this out with, and in one bold colour.  possibly not so big.  that aside, i think it''s dead impressive - and your models looks and poses are SO right for the band name.  bravo you.  for the photo - 10.  but the title IS part of the overall look this week, so i think it feels more an 8.</td>', 'this is so werid - you two guys look almost exactly like superb band Lamb.  this so very fits the challenge!  i''m not greatly keen on the font - something a bit less, erm, scruffy (?) might suit a little better - something like the one i''m typing this out with, and in one bold colour.  possibly not so big.  that aside, i think it''s dead impressive - and your models looks and poses are SO right for the band name.  bravo you.  for the photo - 10.  but the title IS part of the overall look this week, so i think it feels more an 8.', '2004-07-26 15:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(826311, 92846, 13119, '<td valign="top">Cool band name and GREAT photo! &lt;9&gt;</td>', 'Cool band name and GREAT photo! <9>', '2004-07-26 15:56:46.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(826337, 93561, 22922, '<td valign="top">Nice, but I would do without the graininess, very convincing album cover.</td>', 'Nice, but I would do without the graininess, very convincing album cover.', '2004-07-26 16:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(826365, 93033, 12962, '<td valign="top">Looks and sounds like the real deal.  Good job!</td>', 'Looks and sounds like the real deal.  Good job!', '2004-07-26 16:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(826385, 93434, 2752, '<td valign="top">too overexposed for my liking but the composition is great7</td>', 'too overexposed for my liking but the composition is great7', '2004-07-26 17:29:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(826387, 93506, 13365, '<td valign="top">Great photo, i just wish the girl was a bit sharper</td>', 'Great photo, i just wish the girl was a bit sharper', '2004-07-26 17:31:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(826390, 92727, 22671, '<td valign="top">I love everything about the photo except for the gradient effect.</td>', 'I love everything about the photo except for the gradient effect.', '2004-07-26 17:34:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(826393, 93597, 2752, '<td valign="top">lovely composition but I wonder if using cascaders instead on cascades would be more to the pont of the challenge?</td>', 'lovely composition but I wonder if using cascaders instead on cascades would be more to the pont of the challenge?', '2004-07-26 17:38:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(826394, 93334, 22671, '<td valign="top">Very witty setup.  I think the photo is a bit too dark making the text stick out too much.  If you wanted to keep the darkness, I think raising the contrast, sharpness, and adding some gritty noise might help the subjects stand apart from the background more.</td>', 'Very witty setup.  I think the photo is a bit too dark making the text stick out too much.  If you wanted to keep the darkness, I think raising the contrast, sharpness, and adding some gritty noise might help the subjects stand apart from the background more.', '2004-07-26 17:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(826400, 92897, 22671, '<td valign="top">Awesome pic.  The text is a bit cheesy, but the bird really catches your eyes.</td>', 'Awesome pic.  The text is a bit cheesy, but the bird really catches your eyes.', '2004-07-26 17:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(826404, 93470, 10263, '<td valign="top">This is totally weird but I like it :) Colors are nice. Not crazy about the band''s name and the wording probably could have been a little more creative but its a fun photo. BTW can that cow breathe in there?? Don''t MAKE me call the ASPCA!</td>', 'This is totally weird but I like it :) Colors are nice. Not crazy about the band''s name and the wording probably could have been a little more creative but its a fun photo. BTW can that cow breathe in there?? Don''t MAKE me call the ASPCA!', '2004-07-26 17:48:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(826407, 93506, 3087, '<td valign="top">I really like this - the motion infront of the slatey brick wall works well - but I''d prefer to see an element of the girl in better focus - perhaps her face. That''s just me though. This is the kind of thing I could see on a real cover.</td>', 'I really like this - the motion infront of the slatey brick wall works well - but I''d prefer to see an element of the girl in better focus - perhaps her face. That''s just me though. This is the kind of thing I could see on a real cover.', '2004-07-26 17:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(826408, 93303, 22671, '<td valign="top">No idea what it is but it''s adorable, even while maintaining a determined aggressive look.</td>', 'No idea what it is but it''s adorable, even while maintaining a determined aggressive look.', '2004-07-26 17:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(826409, 93237, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like this idea very much and would have scored it even higher had it had some text on it to further develop the idea.</td>', 'I like this idea very much and would have scored it even higher had it had some text on it to further develop the idea.', '2004-07-26 17:54:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(826412, 93573, 3087, '<td valign="top">This really is a wonderful image - the detail is extraordinary. I''d score this more highly if I could see it with text to understand what kind of finished look you had in mind.</td>', 'This really is a wonderful image - the detail is extraordinary. I''d score this more highly if I could see it with text to understand what kind of finished look you had in mind.', '2004-07-26 17:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(826421, 93444, 3087, '<td valign="top">The image is wonderful in richness of colour, in detail and in composition (the stem is angled perfectly down from that corner). The choice of font lets this down for me - it just doesn''t seem to fit well. I am also not keen on the choice for white as a frame for the image.</td>', 'The image is wonderful in richness of colour, in detail and in composition (the stem is angled perfectly down from that corner). The choice of font lets this down for me - it just doesn''t seem to fit well. I am also not keen on the choice for white as a frame for the image.', '2004-07-26 17:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(826423, 93156, 3087, '<td valign="top">Like the idea a lot and think it would work equally well in a square format which means it would work for both CD and cassette releases. And LPs if any bands even release those any more... or even know what they are any more... Anyway, I digress. Exposure seems a little off - the back rim of the glass merges too much into the background for me.</td>', 'Like the idea a lot and think it would work equally well in a square format which means it would work for both CD and cassette releases. And LPs if any bands even release those any more... or even know what they are any more... Anyway, I digress. Exposure seems a little off - the back rim of the glass merges too much into the background for me.', '2004-07-26 18:02:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(826427, 93497, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the surreal feel of this one and the motion within the doll''s skirt. The colour repetition of the green and pink of the skirt in the flowers and leaves is also clever.</td>', 'I like the surreal feel of this one and the motion within the doll''s skirt. The colour repetition of the green and pink of the skirt in the flowers and leaves is also clever.', '2004-07-26 18:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(826432, 93594, 3087, '<td valign="top">Could be more tightly cropped to lose windscreen and wing mirror.</td>', 'Could be more tightly cropped to lose windscreen and wing mirror.', '2004-07-26 18:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(826435, 93568, 3087, '<td valign="top">The dead critter doesn''t grab me, visually, as the details are a little lost in the mass of black but I do like the lighting and background colour very much.</td>', 'The dead critter doesn''t grab me, visually, as the details are a little lost in the mass of black but I do like the lighting and background colour very much.', '2004-07-26 18:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(826447, 93440, 3087, '<td valign="top">Not keen on text - too many fonts and I''d assume it read PDC not DPC... but like the lighting and picture.</td>', 'Not keen on text - too many fonts and I''d assume it read PDC not DPC... but like the lighting and picture.', '2004-07-26 18:17:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(826449, 92723, 16230, '<td valign="top">I think the image is a little too dark overall. Other than that it''s very nice.<br/></td>', 'I think the image is a little too dark overall. Other than that it''s very nice.', '2004-07-26 18:19:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(826450, 93504, 509, '<td valign="top">The lighting here gives a nice contrast with the blue sky.  I think the D P C text could be arranged a little better, maybe running along the beam as the "Shoot L.A." is.  Nice job.</td>', 'The lighting here gives a nice contrast with the blue sky.  I think the D P C text could be arranged a little better, maybe running along the beam as the "Shoot L.A." is.  Nice job.', '2004-07-26 18:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(826451, 93110, 3087, '<td valign="top">I think this is just superb (and it''s a 10 vote from me). It''s just so surreal and yet just the kind of quirky idea I can imagine being used on a real album cover. It''s fun, colourful, well taken and the image composition seems to have been taken with the text position in mind. Love it!</td>', 'I think this is just superb (and it''s a 10 vote from me). It''s just so surreal and yet just the kind of quirky idea I can imagine being used on a real album cover. It''s fun, colourful, well taken and the image composition seems to have been taken with the text position in mind. Love it!', '2004-07-26 18:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(826452, 93561, 16230, '<td valign="top">Too grainy, and the subject is a bit depressing too.</td>', 'Too grainy, and the subject is a bit depressing too.', '2004-07-26 18:21:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(826453, 93210, 16301, '<td valign="top">Great idea, especially the dirty face and expression. I could see a ribbon under it (hopefully) 10<br/> <br/>Good luck...</td>', 'Great idea, especially the dirty face and expression. I could see a ribbon under it (hopefully) 10 Good luck...', '2004-07-26 18:22:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(826454, 93210, 509, '<td valign="top">A very aggressive photo, the white of the eyes and the teeth adds to the already well done contrasts in the shot.  I like the font as well.  I think it would be even better with the logo "EX" for explicit lyrics at the lower right = )  I think it would fit based on the cover shot.</td>', 'A very aggressive photo, the white of the eyes and the teeth adds to the already well done contrasts in the shot.  I like the font as well.  I think it would be even better with the logo "EX" for explicit lyrics at the lower right = )  I think it would fit based on the cover shot.', '2004-07-26 18:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(826455, 93210, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is just wonderful. 10! It''s so incredibly striking - there is such a strong connection - the eyes and expression are superb. So too is the mud and cloth. Black and white, high contrast and composition all spot on. Oh and the font and placement of text also works very well. Superb!</td>', 'This is just wonderful. 10! It''s so incredibly striking - there is such a strong connection - the eyes and expression are superb. So too is the mud and cloth. Black and white, high contrast and composition all spot on. Oh and the font and placement of text also works very well. Superb!', '2004-07-26 18:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(826456, 92980, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely subtle use of shallow DOF. Wonderful viewpoint choice and composition is just excellent. Font choice and text placement also work very well. All in all a very strong image which I think any contemporary African music act would be very proud of. 10</td>', 'Lovely subtle use of shallow DOF. Wonderful viewpoint choice and composition is just excellent. Font choice and text placement also work very well. All in all a very strong image which I think any contemporary African music act would be very proud of. 10', '2004-07-26 18:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(826457, 92928, 16230, '<td valign="top">Can''t say I like the location much. The background is too cluttered and competes for attention with the subject. Blurring it with a shallow DOF may have helped.</td>', 'Can''t say I like the location much. The background is too cluttered and competes for attention with the subject. Blurring it with a shallow DOF may have helped.', '2004-07-26 18:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(826458, 92897, 3087, '<td valign="top">Very strong image and I like how shadow on underbelly merges with black background. Text colour and position works well. 9</td>', 'Very strong image and I like how shadow on underbelly merges with black background. Text colour and position works well. 9', '2004-07-26 18:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(826460, 93011, 3087, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition - I love the way it''s both abstract and yet perfectly recognisable at the same time. Focus seems a touch soft in areas and the lighting is a bit uneven. Text positioning works well. 9</td>', 'Excellent composition - I love the way it''s both abstract and yet perfectly recognisable at the same time. Focus seems a touch soft in areas and the lighting is a bit uneven. Text positioning works well. 9', '2004-07-26 18:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
