(826463, 93314, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image though shame about the light reflections showing so much of the studio set up - would diffused light sources help? Love richness of  colour and DOF choice which throws eyebrow out of focus. 9</td>', 'Beautiful image though shame about the light reflections showing so much of the studio set up - would diffused light sources help? Love richness of  colour and DOF choice which throws eyebrow out of focus. 9', '2004-07-26 18:27:40.000000', NULL, 1),
