(826468, 93476, 3087, '<td valign="top">Superb design - remind me of some of Arnit''s work (not in the sense of being copied but in the sense of creativity and in the ability to express enigma in portraiture). Not keen on the font choice but it''s not awful either. 9</td>', 'Superb design - remind me of some of Arnit''s work (not in the sense of being copied but in the sense of creativity and in the ability to express enigma in portraiture). Not keen on the font choice but it''s not awful either. 9', '2004-07-26 18:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(826470, 92894, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the somewhat surreal feel to this image - - - and yet why should a lone doll feel so surreal? Very intriguing. Black and white works very well and composition, including text position, is excellent. 10</td>', 'I like the somewhat surreal feel to this image - - - and yet why should a lone doll feel so surreal? Very intriguing. Black and white works very well and composition, including text position, is excellent. 10', '2004-07-26 18:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
