(826493, 93127, 6999, '<td valign="top">I have no intention of voting on this challenge, it''s just too weird, but this has made me laugh so hard it shouldn''t be legal. Absolutely fantastic work, just magic. I''ll put a ten here so the comment registers, but expect it to disappear :-)</td>', 'I have no intention of voting on this challenge, it''s just too weird, but this has made me laugh so hard it shouldn''t be legal. Absolutely fantastic work, just magic. I''ll put a ten here so the comment registers, but expect it to disappear :-)', '2004-07-26 18:38:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(826494, 92937, 3087, '<td valign="top">What in incredible album cover! His expression is intriguing and the way he''s looking to his side and into the frame works very well. The lighting on the guitarist next to the rich darkness of the water behind - and yet not quite so dark that one can''t see what the background is. Composition is superb. Text position and colour (matching his Tshirt) are excellent - not quite as keen on font choice but it''s still good. This one is a definite 10. Excellent!</td>', 'What in incredible album cover! His expression is intriguing and the way he''s looking to his side and into the frame works very well. The lighting on the guitarist next to the rich darkness of the water behind - and yet not quite so dark that one can''t see what the background is. Composition is superb. Text position and colour (matching his Tshirt) are excellent - not quite as keen on font choice but it''s still good. This one is a definite 10. Excellent!', '2004-07-26 18:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(826496, 93468, 20375, '<td valign="top">Love the duotone effect. Text font looks great.<br/>I don''t feel the band name, and picture jive very well.<br/>Still..an "8" because it looks so damn nice!</td>', 'Love the duotone effect. Text font looks great.I don''t feel the band name, and picture jive very well.Still..an "8" because it looks so damn nice!', '2004-07-26 18:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
