(826498, 93470, 3087, '<td valign="top">I really, really like this. It''s so absurd (in the best, surreal sense of the word). Composition is excellent - including the whole cow would have lead to a boring and static image - this way we have a suggestion of a space-cow exploring the frame. Text position and font works perfectly. Wouldn''t change a thing. 10</td>', 'I really, really like this. It''s so absurd (in the best, surreal sense of the word). Composition is excellent - including the whole cow would have lead to a boring and static image - this way we have a suggestion of a space-cow exploring the frame. Text position and font works perfectly. Wouldn''t change a thing. 10', '2004-07-26 18:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
