(826503, 92706, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is my highest score for images with no text added as the text allows me to see what the photographer had in mind when they designed and shot the image. I just adore the high contrast black and white treatment. I love the detail in the brick, concrete, gravel, pipe, grass, window and paint.... all so intriguing. The composition could not be any stronger. It''s wonderful. This will be added to my favourites but I''m voting it only a 9 for this challenge.</td>', 'This is my highest score for images with no text added as the text allows me to see what the photographer had in mind when they designed and shot the image. I just adore the high contrast black and white treatment. I love the detail in the brick, concrete, gravel, pipe, grass, window and paint.... all so intriguing. The composition could not be any stronger. It''s wonderful. This will be added to my favourites but I''m voting it only a 9 for this challenge.', '2004-07-26 18:42:45.000000', NULL, 1),
