(827193, 93490, 20395, '<td valign="top">I''m not one to complaint about post processing, but I think that the treatment on the leaves might be a little severe. The grey of the back leaves is very close to the sky, and they blend in quite a bit.</td>', 'I''m not one to complaint about post processing, but I think that the treatment on the leaves might be a little severe. The grey of the back leaves is very close to the sky, and they blend in quite a bit.', '2004-07-27 06:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
