(827265, 93490, 20375, '<td valign="top">I love the album.<br/>Maybe just a little too much text at bottom. Still the image has a very "retro" feel to it that I like. Nice job.</td>', 'I love the album.Maybe just a little too much text at bottom. Still the image has a very "retro" feel to it that I like. Nice job.', '2004-07-27 08:01:35.000000', NULL, 1),
