(827268, 93421, 20375, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot here. Title is a bit weak.....picture would definately suit a "D........P.......Classical  type of title. Still this is very pleasing to the eye. Good choice of colour on the font.<br/>Nice composition using lines from the road.</td>', 'Lovely shot here. Title is a bit weak.....picture would definately suit a "D........P.......Classical  type of title. Still this is very pleasing to the eye. Good choice of colour on the font.Nice composition using lines from the road.', '2004-07-27 08:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(827271, 93589, 20375, '<td valign="top">I think your going for a look here. Almost got it but the model''s shoes and pants ruin it for you. Black jeans with doc martens maybe? <br/>Some people will say overexposed but your going for an effect here. Good job.</td>', 'I think your going for a look here. Almost got it but the model''s shoes and pants ruin it for you. Black jeans with doc martens maybe? Some people will say overexposed but your going for an effect here. Good job.', '2004-07-27 08:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
