(827279, 93556, 20375, '<td valign="top">Only thing hurting this entry is the two large out of focus objects in the foreground. Otherwise ..........very nice.<br/>Good  title, the text looks great!</td>', 'Only thing hurting this entry is the two large out of focus objects in the foreground. Otherwise ..........very nice.Good  title, the text looks great!', '2004-07-27 08:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
