(827844, 93434, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great image but not keen on blown out highlights - not sure if it''s exposure or deliberate post processing? Excellent pose, good expressions. Position of text is great but font doesn''t seem to reflect casual and easy pose/ clothes. 7</td>', 'Great image but not keen on blown out highlights - not sure if it''s exposure or deliberate post processing? Excellent pose, good expressions. Position of text is great but font doesn''t seem to reflect casual and easy pose/ clothes. 7', '2004-07-27 16:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(827849, 93109, 3087, '<td valign="top">Without the cigarette packet the composition is pretty strong - the V of the shirt and tie fairly centred and the diagonal of the sax more assymetrical - balanced to the right by the heavy tubey end bit. But the cigarette packet seems to really throw that composition out and doesn''t really make sense to me in terms of position. Black and white image with red from text works well. 7</td>', 'Without the cigarette packet the composition is pretty strong - the V of the shirt and tie fairly centred and the diagonal of the sax more assymetrical - balanced to the right by the heavy tubey end bit. But the cigarette packet seems to really throw that composition out and doesn''t really make sense to me in terms of position. Black and white image with red from text works well. 7', '2004-07-27 16:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(827854, 93567, 4007, '<td valign="top">This image seems way too busy.  It''s hard to tell what anything in this jumble of stuff really is, and the items don''t really interest me much.  In addition, the text you''ve chosen is nearly impossible to read due to both the style and colors used.</td>', 'This image seems way too busy.  It''s hard to tell what anything in this jumble of stuff really is, and the items don''t really interest me much.  In addition, the text you''ve chosen is nearly impossible to read due to both the style and colors used.', '2004-07-27 16:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(827857, 93606, 3087, '<td valign="top">Interesting image (though I''m not sure his legs are really of that much interest) and nice lighting. Text nice and simple and modern, works well. 7</td>', 'Interesting image (though I''m not sure his legs are really of that much interest) and nice lighting. Text nice and simple and modern, works well. 7', '2004-07-27 16:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(827861, 93595, 10263, '<td valign="top">Beautiful eyes. Not sure the knife does anything for me. I like the font and the colors.</td>', 'Beautiful eyes. Not sure the knife does anything for me. I like the font and the colors.', '2004-07-27 16:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(827862, 92861, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nicely done! Lighting (or colour cast?) creates quite a surreal and disturbing feel. Text works well. Composition, with text weight, colour and position, is strong. 7</td>', 'Nicely done! Lighting (or colour cast?) creates quite a surreal and disturbing feel. Text works well. Composition, with text weight, colour and position, is strong. 7', '2004-07-27 16:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(827863, 93369, 3087, '<td valign="top">Excellent font and font colour choice. This is quite dark (I mean in atmosphere) and that fits well with band name and the ironic album title. 7</td>', 'Excellent font and font colour choice. This is quite dark (I mean in atmosphere) and that fits well with band name and the ironic album title. 7', '2004-07-27 16:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(827866, 92915, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice image, can''t see it on a real album cover - just doesn''t strike me as an image that fits any genre of music - pop, rock, classic, country? Nicely captured though. 7</td>', 'Nice image, can''t see it on a real album cover - just doesn''t strike me as an image that fits any genre of music - pop, rock, classic, country? Nicely captured though. 7', '2004-07-27 16:33:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(827867, 93106, 3087, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for shallow DOF so this is one of the highest scores for an entry without text. The reason I want to see text is because it shows me what consideration you gave to the additional text and it''s impact on composition. Great photo though! 7</td>', 'I''m a sucker for shallow DOF so this is one of the highest scores for an entry without text. The reason I want to see text is because it shows me what consideration you gave to the additional text and it''s impact on composition. Great photo though! 7', '2004-07-27 16:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(827868, 93585, 10263, '<td valign="top">LOL Love the humor and the colors. I like the graphics too. What the heck are those ugly creatures!</td>', 'LOL Love the humor and the colors. I like the graphics too. What the heck are those ugly creatures!', '2004-07-27 16:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(827870, 93580, 3087, '<td valign="top">How quirky. The blue light effect (looks like he''s glowing) is clever but I don''t think I like it. Also not keen on that DPC embossed font thing. 7</td>', 'How quirky. The blue light effect (looks like he''s glowing) is clever but I don''t think I like it. Also not keen on that DPC embossed font thing. 7', '2004-07-27 16:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(827874, 93420, 10263, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, if there''s a connection to the title and the photo I''m not getting it. The shadows are a bit harsh. Composition is good, I like the use of negative space.</td>', 'Hmmm, if there''s a connection to the title and the photo I''m not getting it. The shadows are a bit harsh. Composition is good, I like the use of negative space.', '2004-07-27 16:38:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(827875, 93611, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, nice mood. Would prefer to see text to understand finished composition. 7</td>', 'Nice lighting, nice mood. Would prefer to see text to understand finished composition. 7', '2004-07-27 16:38:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(827876, 93566, 3087, '<td valign="top">Interesting image and nice use of one blue pebble. 7</td>', 'Interesting image and nice use of one blue pebble. 7', '2004-07-27 16:39:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(827877, 93418, 3087, '<td valign="top">Like the use of the "wide screen film" black bars. Really adds an extra dimension to this. Text design works very well. 9</td>', 'Like the use of the "wide screen film" black bars. Really adds an extra dimension to this. Text design works very well. 9', '2004-07-27 16:39:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(827878, 93465, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice simple shot which is almost abstract in feel. Interesting choice of font for "moonglow" - not sure I like it. The white font at the top works well. 7</td>', 'Nice simple shot which is almost abstract in feel. Interesting choice of font for "moonglow" - not sure I like it. The white font at the top works well. 7', '2004-07-27 16:40:35.000000', NULL, 1),
