(827938, 93506, 16301, '<td valign="top">Cool cover, I like the blur. Great choice of background too. Nice burning job to emphasize the subject. I also like the different sizes of the text. I would have cloned out that flower (or whatever it is) on her dress to make everything black. Great cover (8)</td>', 'Cool cover, I like the blur. Great choice of background too. Nice burning job to emphasize the subject. I also like the different sizes of the text. I would have cloned out that flower (or whatever it is) on her dress to make everything black. Great cover (8)', '2004-07-27 17:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(827942, 92897, 14603, '<td valign="top">Very clever play on words and cracking picture into the bargain.</td>', 'Very clever play on words and cracking picture into the bargain.', '2004-07-27 17:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(827955, 92706, 14603, '<td valign="top">Nice to come across an image with a bit of originality..which actually looks like something you would find in a music store.<br/>Well done....9</td>', 'Nice to come across an image with a bit of originality..which actually looks like something you would find in a music store.Well done....9', '2004-07-27 17:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
