(827999, 93497, 20375, '<td valign="top">Believe it or not, at one point I had the same name!<br/>Very cute, good capture.<br/>Lots of work and thought went into this.</td>', 'Believe it or not, at one point I had the same name!Very cute, good capture.Lots of work and thought went into this.', '2004-07-27 17:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
