(828043, 93011, 16301, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, I would have had the lip marks more red and solid. I also would have changed the font to some sort of "script" because it looks a bit static and plain this way :)<br/> <br/>But very good and original idea (8)</td>', 'Nice idea, I would have had the lip marks more red and solid. I also would have changed the font to some sort of "script" because it looks a bit static and plain this way :) But very good and original idea (8)', '2004-07-27 18:06:49.000000', NULL, 1),
