(828050, 93561, 16301, '<td valign="top">Cool idea, I like the deformed doll and grain. I would have had it in sepia or B&amp;W because the wood is too blue for my taste :)<br/> <br/>Nice cover (8)</td>', 'Cool idea, I like the deformed doll and grain. I would have had it in sepia or B&W because the wood is too blue for my taste :) Nice cover (8)', '2004-07-27 18:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
