(831510, 93410, 10170, '<td valign="top">Absolutely sensational macro shot.  Love it as an album cover as well .... but would prefer it as just the photo as it is so great (text great though for album, so no points lost at all, I just think this is such a sensational macro!).  The colours are particularly good for a shot of this type.  10</td>', 'Absolutely sensational macro shot.  Love it as an album cover as well .... but would prefer it as just the photo as it is so great (text great though for album, so no points lost at all, I just think this is such a sensational macro!).  The colours are particularly good for a shot of this type.  10', '2004-07-29 05:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(831543, 93210, 10170, '<td valign="top">Too good for words.  Sensational photo, and then it makes an album cover that I can l really see as being real.  Great use of light, contrasts and even the text.  The model is excellent, as is the pose, use of props etc etc etc.  Just sensational, has to be a ribbon and in a very strong field of competition in this challenge.  10++</td>', 'Too good for words.  Sensational photo, and then it makes an album cover that I can l really see as being real.  Great use of light, contrasts and even the text.  The model is excellent, as is the pose, use of props etc etc etc.  Just sensational, has to be a ribbon and in a very strong field of competition in this challenge.  10++', '2004-07-29 06:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(831545, 92897, 10170, '<td valign="top">Excellent.  Great photo and really looks like an actual album.</td>', 'Excellent.  Great photo and really looks like an actual album.', '2004-07-29 06:08:51.000000', NULL, 1),
