(832141, 93420, 4007, '<td valign="top">I really like this.  The band name is not only believable but somewhat likable.  The photo is crisp, amusing, memorable, fits stylisticly with the band name, and functions well compositionally as an album cover.  Great work.</td>', 'I really like this.  The band name is not only believable but somewhat likable.  The photo is crisp, amusing, memorable, fits stylisticly with the band name, and functions well compositionally as an album cover.  Great work.', '2004-07-29 15:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(832152, 93210, 4007, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo a lot.  The tones are strong, the expression/emotion comes through well.  It''s interesting and would both attract attention and be memorable.  Unfortunately I think your band name is rather unrealistic.  It''s not really catchy, cool, or easy to remember, so I can''t imagine an actual band using it.  Of course, I''m more interested in the photo than the name.  Great work on the whole. 9</td>', 'I really like this photo a lot.  The tones are strong, the expression/emotion comes through well.  It''s interesting and would both attract attention and be memorable.  Unfortunately I think your band name is rather unrealistic.  It''s not really catchy, cool, or easy to remember, so I can''t imagine an actual band using it.  Of course, I''m more interested in the photo than the name.  Great work on the whole. 9', '2004-07-29 15:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
