(832358, 92846, 3569, '<td valign="top">great timing, did you try a bit more contrast to brighten the outer branches and darken the sky.</td>', 'great timing, did you try a bit more contrast to brighten the outer branches and darken the sky.', '2004-07-29 17:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(832394, 93369, 509, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if this is from the monitor I''m using (at a library...), but there seems to be a lack of contrast in this shot, as though it was lightened to show the person.  If this is the case, then the exposure isn''t long enough imho.  If this was taken with the person lying within the light of the street lamp that is directly behind him, I think it would be vastly improved.  I''m also confused as to what the object behind his head is and how it contributes to the photo.  Overall, I like the idea, but see room for improvement in the execution.</td>', 'I''m not sure if this is from the monitor I''m using (at a library...), but there seems to be a lack of contrast in this shot, as though it was lightened to show the person.  If this is the case, then the exposure isn''t long enough imho.  If this was taken with the person lying within the light of the street lamp that is directly behind him, I think it would be vastly improved.  I''m also confused as to what the object behind his head is and how it contributes to the photo.  Overall, I like the idea, but see room for improvement in the execution.', '2004-07-29 18:14:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(832401, 93208, 509, '<td valign="top">Good use of color.  The exposure is nice too, but burning the background elements a bit would add separation between the subject and the surroundings, especially the white object to the right of the man''s face.</td>', 'Good use of color.  The exposure is nice too, but burning the background elements a bit would add separation between the subject and the surroundings, especially the white object to the right of the man''s face.', '2004-07-29 18:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(832403, 92915, 509, '<td valign="top">Very nice macro shot.  He certainly does look dedicated.  A stretch on the band name (just not something I would expect to see), but I''m not wild about the DPC title restrictions to begin with = P<br/>Nice work. -8-</td>', 'Very nice macro shot.  He certainly does look dedicated.  A stretch on the band name (just not something I would expect to see), but I''m not wild about the DPC title restrictions to begin with = PNice work. -8-', '2004-07-29 18:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(832408, 93522, 509, '<td valign="top">Great exposure and clever title, but the "Denver" seems forced (well, I guess if this was taken in Denver it would have more meaning, but for the purpose of this challenge, that information isn''t available to us voters)  I think I could see this as an album cover, and technically, this is very well done.</td>', 'Great exposure and clever title, but the "Denver" seems forced (well, I guess if this was taken in Denver it would have more meaning, but for the purpose of this challenge, that information isn''t available to us voters)  I think I could see this as an album cover, and technically, this is very well done.', '2004-07-29 18:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(832413, 93428, 509, '<td valign="top">The text positioning adds strength to the composition, but the exposure is a little off for my tastes.  As there appears to be a spotlight on the puppets, I would have spot metered on that, making the rest of the stage darker (this might not have been possible - this looks like a tough setting to get a good shot from).  This would have at least fixed the highlight clipping observable on the chair and table.  The title and idea, however, are clever and fit the challenge well.</td>', 'The text positioning adds strength to the composition, but the exposure is a little off for my tastes.  As there appears to be a spotlight on the puppets, I would have spot metered on that, making the rest of the stage darker (this might not have been possible - this looks like a tough setting to get a good shot from).  This would have at least fixed the highlight clipping observable on the chair and table.  The title and idea, however, are clever and fit the challenge well.', '2004-07-29 18:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(832417, 93202, 509, '<td valign="top">In this shot, I am drawn more to the sunset in the back of the shot.  That said, there are several elements that attract attention and lend themselves to be slight distractions - the stoplight, imho is unnecessary, but I like the curver and perspective lines created by the street.  I guess I''m not sure what I would change with this shot.  The pink clouds are attractive, possibly a closer crop on that would work.</td>', 'In this shot, I am drawn more to the sunset in the back of the shot.  That said, there are several elements that attract attention and lend themselves to be slight distractions - the stoplight, imho is unnecessary, but I like the curver and perspective lines created by the street.  I guess I''m not sure what I would change with this shot.  The pink clouds are attractive, possibly a closer crop on that would work.', '2004-07-29 18:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(832422, 93589, 509, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, but would suggest a little more grain, or editing the blacks (such as the shirt and the text on the wall) to be a little darker - they appear gray on the monitor I am using, I will recheck this.  Other than that, I like the subject and composition.  The highlights aren''t bad, but maybe in a little more moderation (maybe less on the sidewalk, while leaving the elements on the person overexposed).  Overall a nice job.</td>', 'I like this shot, but would suggest a little more grain, or editing the blacks (such as the shirt and the text on the wall) to be a little darker - they appear gray on the monitor I am using, I will recheck this.  Other than that, I like the subject and composition.  The highlights aren''t bad, but maybe in a little more moderation (maybe less on the sidewalk, while leaving the elements on the person overexposed).  Overall a nice job.', '2004-07-29 18:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(832424, 93606, 509, '<td valign="top">Awesome trick - well executed.  I''m gonna assume this was a long exposure that your subject jumped out of.  The lighting, whether created in post or not, is great.  One of the best this round.</td>', 'Awesome trick - well executed.  I''m gonna assume this was a long exposure that your subject jumped out of.  The lighting, whether created in post or not, is great.  One of the best this round.', '2004-07-29 18:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(832427, 92544, 509, '<td valign="top">As a graveyard shot, I think black and white would better suit this.  The bright blue skies don''t fit the theme.  Compositionally, I think this could also be improved, maybe by getting closer in on the graves or using a wider aperture to throw the background out of focus.</td>', 'As a graveyard shot, I think black and white would better suit this.  The bright blue skies don''t fit the theme.  Compositionally, I think this could also be improved, maybe by getting closer in on the graves or using a wider aperture to throw the background out of focus.', '2004-07-29 18:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(832429, 93314, 509, '<td valign="top">Great photo.  I love the colors and focus.  One of my favorites this round. -10-</td>', 'Great photo.  I love the colors and focus.  One of my favorites this round. -10-', '2004-07-29 18:31:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(832440, 93311, 509, '<td valign="top">Creative shot = )  It makes me hungry.</td>', 'Creative shot = )  It makes me hungry.', '2004-07-29 18:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(832443, 93443, 509, '<td valign="top">I find the album cover appealing.  The color tones and light source are very nice.</td>', 'I find the album cover appealing.  The color tones and light source are very nice.', '2004-07-29 18:41:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(832444, 93246, 509, '<td valign="top">Nice use of black and white.  I''d prefer the font if it was smoother.  It would make for a nice contrast against the grain and texture of the statues.  Well done.</td>', 'Nice use of black and white.  I''d prefer the font if it was smoother.  It would make for a nice contrast against the grain and texture of the statues.  Well done.', '2004-07-29 18:42:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(832447, 93550, 509, '<td valign="top">I have no idea what a crooner is....which adds to the country-esque quality of this shot.  Good use of repetition.  Some saturation boosting, particularly in the reds, might give more "pop".</td>', 'I have no idea what a crooner is....which adds to the country-esque quality of this shot.  Good use of repetition.  Some saturation boosting, particularly in the reds, might give more "pop".', '2004-07-29 18:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(832452, 93421, 509, '<td valign="top">Kind of the idea I was going for in mine, but I wasn''t explicit enough = P<br/>If not for the flare from the sun, I think this would be a great shot.  A tighter vertical crop should fix that up though.  Nice work.</td>', 'Kind of the idea I was going for in mine, but I wasn''t explicit enough = PIf not for the flare from the sun, I think this would be a great shot.  A tighter vertical crop should fix that up though.  Nice work.', '2004-07-29 18:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(832455, 93585, 509, '<td valign="top">Lol, great shot.  Did you go out and find a bunch of molting insects for this and line them up?  If so, nice effort.  The exposure, focus, composition, etc. are all just right imho.  Great job.</td>', 'Lol, great shot.  Did you go out and find a bunch of molting insects for this and line them up?  If so, nice effort.  The exposure, focus, composition, etc. are all just right imho.  Great job.', '2004-07-29 18:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(832456, 93602, 509, '<td valign="top">This would make a good solo album cover.  I like how though the background is black, there is still separation between that and the subject''s outfit.  The facial expression is also a nice touch.  Well done.</td>', 'This would make a good solo album cover.  I like how though the background is black, there is still separation between that and the subject''s outfit.  The facial expression is also a nice touch.  Well done.', '2004-07-29 18:48:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(832458, 93588, 509, '<td valign="top">Creative title.  As for the photo, well, I think it might work for a punk band, but the shot itself has some issues.  Bounce flash or backlighting could help eliminate the shadows and add contrast to the subject.  The facial expression looks artificial to me, but the idea is clever nonetheless.</td>', 'Creative title.  As for the photo, well, I think it might work for a punk band, but the shot itself has some issues.  Bounce flash or backlighting could help eliminate the shadows and add contrast to the subject.  The facial expression looks artificial to me, but the idea is clever nonetheless.', '2004-07-29 18:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(832498, 93610, 509, '<td valign="top">I like the deep red and the string textures - the macro quality is quite good in that respect.  Nicely done</td>', 'I like the deep red and the string textures - the macro quality is quite good in that respect.  Nicely done', '2004-07-29 19:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(832501, 93177, 509, '<td valign="top">The colors are nice, but there really isn''t anything to draw my attention here.  Text might be one possibility, or some unusual rock formation. (I don''t count the rocks on the right as the red colors invariably draw my eye to that part of the image).  I like the subject and I think there are a lot of great shots that could be had of it.</td>', 'The colors are nice, but there really isn''t anything to draw my attention here.  Text might be one possibility, or some unusual rock formation. (I don''t count the rocks on the right as the red colors invariably draw my eye to that part of the image).  I like the subject and I think there are a lot of great shots that could be had of it.', '2004-07-29 19:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(832504, 93616, 509, '<td valign="top">For the "corrupted" part, I think the image could do more to show corruption.  The side lighting is a little distracting as well.</td>', 'For the "corrupted" part, I think the image could do more to show corruption.  The side lighting is a little distracting as well.', '2004-07-29 19:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(832508, 93417, 509, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  I''m not really a fan of kid shots, but this would make a good album cover, especially for a punk band. -6-</td>', 'Nice idea.  I''m not really a fan of kid shots, but this would make a good album cover, especially for a punk band. -6-', '2004-07-29 19:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(832510, 93437, 509, '<td valign="top">Very moody, the drop shadow text is a positive contribution.  Hard to make out the buildings, but imho, not a detraction.  The glare from the lights is far more important, and adds a surreal quality to the shot.  Excellent.</td>', 'Very moody, the drop shadow text is a positive contribution.  Hard to make out the buildings, but imho, not a detraction.  The glare from the lights is far more important, and adds a surreal quality to the shot.  Excellent.', '2004-07-29 19:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(832512, 93468, 509, '<td valign="top">The font goes great with the grainy nature of the shot.  I really like this, and could definitely see it as an album cover.  Great eye for composition &amp; the text placement.  -10-</td>', 'The font goes great with the grainy nature of the shot.  I really like this, and could definitely see it as an album cover.  Great eye for composition & the text placement.  -10-', '2004-07-29 19:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(832517, 93584, 509, '<td valign="top">A good macro, though it is really a shot comprised entirely of the card artwork.  Still, your exposure is quite good and this would make a nice album cover.  Imho, the "a.k.a. the joker" is not necessary and is a little too much text.</td>', 'A good macro, though it is really a shot comprised entirely of the card artwork.  Still, your exposure is quite good and this would make a nice album cover.  Imho, the "a.k.a. the joker" is not necessary and is a little too much text.', '2004-07-29 19:38:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(832520, 92937, 509, '<td valign="top">Wow...I don''t know how you got this exposure to come out this good, but it really shows.  The lighting and mood is superb.  One of my favorites this round.</td>', 'Wow...I don''t know how you got this exposure to come out this good, but it really shows.  The lighting and mood is superb.  One of my favorites this round.', '2004-07-29 19:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(832536, 93210, 23562, '<td valign="top">Love this photo, Grrrrrrreat!!!</td>', 'Love this photo, Grrrrrrreat!!!', '2004-07-29 19:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(832701, 93303, 23394, '<td valign="top">great shot, great job on the text.  good luck!</td>', 'great shot, great job on the text.  good luck!', '2004-07-29 22:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(832710, 93315, 23394, '<td valign="top">awesome shot.  one of my top picks for the challenge.  hope you do well!</td>', 'awesome shot.  one of my top picks for the challenge.  hope you do well!', '2004-07-29 22:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(832713, 92760, 23394, '<td valign="top">fantastic shot!  hope you score well.  one of my top picks for the challenge.</td>', 'fantastic shot!  hope you score well.  one of my top picks for the challenge.', '2004-07-29 22:06:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(832716, 93468, 23394, '<td valign="top">what a great take.  the shot is awesome and the font perfect.  hope you do well.  one of my top picks for the challenge.</td>', 'what a great take.  the shot is awesome and the font perfect.  hope you do well.  one of my top picks for the challenge.', '2004-07-29 22:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(832723, 93417, 23394, '<td valign="top">ok, how''d you do this...this kid is obviously too young to take direction.  i can''t imagine you just happening upon this situation and going ''oh, lucky me; this fits dpc.''  i mean, is this a case of abuse, or what?  from the look in his eye, this must be, like, what...the 300th shot?  don''t they have child labor laws where you come from?  did the little guy get any cake, or is that how you got the expression?<br/> <br/>btw, this is one of my top picks...great shot, and i hope you do well with it.</td>', 'ok, how''d you do this...this kid is obviously too young to take direction.  i can''t imagine you just happening upon this situation and going ''oh, lucky me; this fits dpc.''  i mean, is this a case of abuse, or what?  from the look in his eye, this must be, like, what...the 300th shot?  don''t they have child labor laws where you come from?  did the little guy get any cake, or is that how you got the expression? btw, this is one of my top picks...great shot, and i hope you do well with it.', '2004-07-29 22:13:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(832761, 93251, 18838, '<td valign="top">sorry ... don''t like the huge DPC in the corner and would have liked only the middle kid on there</td>', 'sorry ... don''t like the huge DPC in the corner and would have liked only the middle kid on there', '2004-07-29 23:02:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(832763, 92706, 18838, '<td valign="top">i like that you did not have to add text to this one ... nice geometry, too</td>', 'i like that you did not have to add text to this one ... nice geometry, too', '2004-07-29 23:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(832772, 93506, 18838, '<td valign="top">wonderful ... my favorite so far!!!<br/>should have made it square, though (crop on the left)</td>', 'wonderful ... my favorite so far!!!should have made it square, though (crop on the left)', '2004-07-29 23:12:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(832775, 93541, 18838, '<td valign="top">that is a hell of a funny sign ... the photo itself does not work so well for me ... also the DPC seems a bit boring</td>', 'that is a hell of a funny sign ... the photo itself does not work so well for me ... also the DPC seems a bit boring', '2004-07-29 23:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(832877, 93586, 8891, '<td valign="top">Let me tell you about the olden days when I cleaned ivory off the old keys and put on the glue and the ivorine replacements....oy...my figures pain at the thought. Any way, a little dark, but I like the composition and the textures and the choice of the text color.</td>', 'Let me tell you about the olden days when I cleaned ivory off the old keys and put on the glue and the ivorine replacements....oy...my figures pain at the thought. Any way, a little dark, but I like the composition and the textures and the choice of the text color.', '2004-07-30 00:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(832883, 93595, 8891, '<td valign="top">I think the knife a bit un-necessary as the eyes in this image represent the title quite well with out it. the reflection on the left of the knife is a distraction  as well as the reflection from it under your(?) eyes.  Keeping the same composition of the head shot and the text, it may have been OK to have the knife held to your left, straight up and down, parallel to the head with the text over it. Just a thought. THe head shot is great.</td>', 'I think the knife a bit un-necessary as the eyes in this image represent the title quite well with out it. the reflection on the left of the knife is a distraction  as well as the reflection from it under your(?) eyes.  Keeping the same composition of the head shot and the text, it may have been OK to have the knife held to your left, straight up and down, parallel to the head with the text over it. Just a thought. THe head shot is great.', '2004-07-30 01:05:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(832937, 93597, 10263, '<td valign="top">You captured the water beautifully. I would rather see  the large  rocks on the right side cropped leaving the falls close to the border.  The hazy look on the left of the falls is good.  You''re probably being scored lower for not having the name of the band on the cover too.</td>', 'You captured the water beautifully. I would rather see  the large  rocks on the right side cropped leaving the falls close to the border.  The hazy look on the left of the falls is good.  You''re probably being scored lower for not having the name of the band on the cover too.', '2004-07-30 03:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(832939, 93410, 10263, '<td valign="top">Striking colors.  Amazing what you can see in a macro. Nice graphics. Amazing clarity.</td>', 'Striking colors.  Amazing what you can see in a macro. Nice graphics. Amazing clarity.', '2004-07-30 03:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(832980, 93011, 12802, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. LIke how it''s split into three, making us look around.</td>', 'Nicely done. LIke how it''s split into three, making us look around.', '2004-07-30 05:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(832983, 93506, 12802, '<td valign="top">Can definately see this being a good album cover.  The text is great, simple yet effective.  I like the blur on the woman too.  Full marks!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-08-02 05:00:08.</i></td>', 'Can definately see this being a good album cover.  The text is great, simple yet effective.  I like the blur on the woman too.  Full marks!', '2004-07-30 05:22:48.000000', '2004-08-02 06:00:08.000000', 1),
(833005, 93210, 12802, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot!  Looked at this one a few times, thinking before I commented.<br/>I really like this, the lighting here is brilliant, really shows of the dirty looks, while showing the perfect whites. Her eyes and teeth really stand out, would look good from a distance to grab your attention if it was actually sitting in a record store.<br/>The font you''ve used is great, the bandage''s texture is really brought out.  Definately full marks from me!<br/></td>', 'Excellent shot!  Looked at this one a few times, thinking before I commented.I really like this, the lighting here is brilliant, really shows of the dirty looks, while showing the perfect whites. Her eyes and teeth really stand out, would look good from a distance to grab your attention if it was actually sitting in a record store.The font you''ve used is great, the bandage''s texture is really brought out.  Definately full marks from me!', '2004-07-30 06:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(833010, 93110, 12802, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, comical looking, but gets the message across well! I like the use of blue throughout it all,  might like the image sharpened a little bit.  Very nice shot!! 9</td>', 'I like this shot, comical looking, but gets the message across well! I like the use of blue throughout it all,  might like the image sharpened a little bit.  Very nice shot!! 9', '2004-07-30 07:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(833011, 93472, 12802, '<td valign="top">The thumbnail on this really grabbed my attention.  I like the actual image, there''s just something about it that I think would do well as an album cover.  8</td>', 'The thumbnail on this really grabbed my attention.  I like the actual image, there''s just something about it that I think would do well as an album cover.  8', '2004-07-30 07:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(833052, 93566, 15832, '<td valign="top">Maby if you would have used more apartuer you could have had everything in fockus. Maby you wanted to have it like that but for me personally i think it could have looked better with the hole DOF. Because I really like the reflection on the drops. ( trees and the sky i guess?)  <br/>Good idea.  6<br/></td>', 'Maby if you would have used more apartuer you could have had everything in fockus. Maby you wanted to have it like that but for me personally i think it could have looked better with the hole DOF. Because I really like the reflection on the drops. ( trees and the sky i guess?)  Good idea.  6', '2004-07-30 08:14:46.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(833062, 93553, 15832, '<td valign="top">Thats a cool idea...<br/>Have you seen the sign from "mynestry of sound" ?<br/>It´s almost just the same..<br/> <br/></td>', 'Thats a cool idea...Have you seen the sign from "mynestry of sound" ?It´s almost just the same.. ', '2004-07-30 08:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(833097, 93434, 15832, '<td valign="top">This is really well done... Maby if the lights where littelbit more to the left you could have hide the shadows from the face better but i´m not sure if that would have destroyed something else. I know how tough lighting can be!! <br/>The setup, the expression and framing is perfect for me.<br/>The head of the guitar is littel bit overexpouserd (it workes great with the faces )but maby  the guitar could have bin fixed in ps.<br/>But all in all... A great done photo... 8</td>', 'This is really well done... Maby if the lights where littelbit more to the left you could have hide the shadows from the face better but i´m not sure if that would have destroyed something else. I know how tough lighting can be!! The setup, the expression and framing is perfect for me.The head of the guitar is littel bit overexpouserd (it workes great with the faces )but maby  the guitar could have bin fixed in ps.But all in all... A great done photo... 8', '2004-07-30 08:34:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(833157, 93602, 11800, '<td valign="top">I would have liked a solid dark background and a square format but it is a decent enough portrait with excellent lighting. There is a faint green tinge in her skin tone that could be easily corrected.<br/>Is she the woodland fairy? I usually take off points when someone gives away their entry in the forums. It''s not fair to the other people that try to keep their entries anon. magnetic9999?</td>', 'I would have liked a solid dark background and a square format but it is a decent enough portrait with excellent lighting. There is a faint green tinge in her skin tone that could be easily corrected.Is she the woodland fairy? I usually take off points when someone gives away their entry in the forums. It''s not fair to the other people that try to keep their entries anon. magnetic9999?', '2004-07-30 09:17:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(833171, 92563, 11800, '<td valign="top">Good concept, well executed. The only thing that could be improved,imo, is the shadow on the side. I would have liked to see the color extend all the way to the edge.</td>', 'Good concept, well executed. The only thing that could be improved,imo, is the shadow on the side. I would have liked to see the color extend all the way to the edge.', '2004-07-30 09:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(833183, 93470, 11800, '<td valign="top">I like it. Simple, but it really reinforces the name of the band.</td>', 'I like it. Simple, but it really reinforces the name of the band.', '2004-07-30 09:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(833196, 93210, 11800, '<td valign="top">I like the opposing "woman in veil" theme of this photo. The dirt lends an especially striking contrast even though it is something I personally dislike. But because it is so bold and so "not pretty", I will give you a 10.</td>', 'I like the opposing "woman in veil" theme of this photo. The dirt lends an especially striking contrast even though it is something I personally dislike. But because it is so bold and so "not pretty", I will give you a 10.', '2004-07-30 09:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(833200, 92894, 21714, '<td valign="top">Great idea, nice composition. I do find the highlights a bit harsh but it''s a very good job.  Well done.</td>', 'Great idea, nice composition. I do find the highlights a bit harsh but it''s a very good job.  Well done.', '2004-07-30 09:45:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(833201, 93210, 21714, '<td valign="top">Brillaint shot. Lovely tones finely balanced. Great detail and good contrast. Excellent B&amp;W. Very well done.</td>', 'Brillaint shot. Lovely tones finely balanced. Great detail and good contrast. Excellent B&W. Very well done.', '2004-07-30 09:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(833206, 93506, 21714, '<td valign="top">Very coll shot. Looks like she''s walking on air. Well done.</td>', 'Very coll shot. Looks like she''s walking on air. Well done.', '2004-07-30 09:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(833211, 93616, 11800, '<td valign="top">Sorry you didn''t get the update on the title. Hope it doesn''t lower your score. She does look like each of the words you used.  She has very expressive eyes and such a lovely pouty mouth, I would have liked to see them closer and with more detail. The picture has noise. I don''t know if that was intentional so it will not effect your score but I think it would have looked better without it. The blown highlights have probably been mentioned a lot but I don''t mind them.</td>', 'Sorry you didn''t get the update on the title. Hope it doesn''t lower your score. She does look like each of the words you used.  She has very expressive eyes and such a lovely pouty mouth, I would have liked to see them closer and with more detail. The picture has noise. I don''t know if that was intentional so it will not effect your score but I think it would have looked better without it. The blown highlights have probably been mentioned a lot but I don''t mind them.', '2004-07-30 09:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(833216, 93597, 12802, '<td valign="top">Really nice long exposure, might have liked it if you''d moved to the left a little to get rid of the rock on the bottom RHS or to make the waterfall more centred.</td>', 'Really nice long exposure, might have liked it if you''d moved to the left a little to get rid of the rock on the bottom RHS or to make the waterfall more centred.', '2004-07-30 10:03:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(833218, 93490, 11800, '<td valign="top">I think all the typing will do this one in. The palm isn''t so bad and the post processing is ok for the challenge. The typeface is boring(sorry) and all the extra stuff doesn''t add to the theme for me. Maybe there is an inside joke that goes with this, but I don''t get it.</td>', 'I think all the typing will do this one in. The palm isn''t so bad and the post processing is ok for the challenge. The typeface is boring(sorry) and all the extra stuff doesn''t add to the theme for me. Maybe there is an inside joke that goes with this, but I don''t get it.', '2004-07-30 10:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(833257, 92724, 11800, '<td valign="top">I like the rainbow. The colors look muddy. Post processing would help bring out more in this shot. I bet the histogram is all bunched up into the mid section. Try adjusting so there is a greater spread or try a curves adjustment to get some light and darks.</td>', 'I like the rainbow. The colors look muddy. Post processing would help bring out more in this shot. I bet the histogram is all bunched up into the mid section. Try adjusting so there is a greater spread or try a curves adjustment to get some light and darks.', '2004-07-30 10:49:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(833264, 93567, 11800, '<td valign="top">Not knowing what the words represent makes it hard to judge this picture. I am assuming that it''s the bank clan? If that is it, the bank is to hard to find.  The picture is to cluttered to have much of an impact.</td>', 'Not knowing what the words represent makes it hard to judge this picture. I am assuming that it''s the bank clan? If that is it, the bank is to hard to find.  The picture is to cluttered to have much of an impact.', '2004-07-30 10:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(833268, 93177, 11800, '<td valign="top">It''s the pits when they change the wording during the challenge! A pretty picture with room for the title within the frame. Could be cropped into a square format without losing important detail. Nice colors. The only concern I would have with it is the lack of details within the shadows.</td>', 'It''s the pits when they change the wording during the challenge! A pretty picture with room for the title within the frame. Could be cropped into a square format without losing important detail. Nice colors. The only concern I would have with it is the lack of details within the shadows.', '2004-07-30 11:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(833360, 93109, 11800, '<td valign="top">I like the dappled light on the suit. I don''t understand why the cigs are there. Sure, they say sixty, but they look way out of place (especially because they don''t have the same dappled light as mentioned above) and they don''t add to the composition. BTW, I smoke so have nothing against showing cigs.</td>', 'I like the dappled light on the suit. I don''t understand why the cigs are there. Sure, they say sixty, but they look way out of place (especially because they don''t have the same dappled light as mentioned above) and they don''t add to the composition. BTW, I smoke so have nothing against showing cigs.', '2004-07-30 12:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(833364, 92723, 24846, '<td valign="top">What a trio of color! The curves of the cherry make me envision a band comprised of 3 daughters from "Deep Purple".</td>', 'What a trio of color! The curves of the cherry make me envision a band comprised of 3 daughters from "Deep Purple".', '2004-07-30 12:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(833372, 93021, 11800, '<td valign="top">I like this. Technically it has some problems, like the highlights and the shadow area below the bottle, but it is a good idea with the visual impact needed to help sell an album. Hope you place well.</td>', 'I like this. Technically it has some problems, like the highlights and the shadow area below the bottle, but it is a good idea with the visual impact needed to help sell an album. Hope you place well.', '2004-07-30 12:50:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(833393, 93418, 11800, '<td valign="top">Nice catch. As an album cover I question the use of the black borders containing nothing. It looks as if almost 1/2 of the available space has been wasted. It might have been better to crop off some of the sides of the picture than to try to create a square with blank filler. The choice might have been justified had there been something placed in the blank portions. Unfortunately, the presentation has to fit within the rules and stand on it''s own within the challenge.</td>', 'Nice catch. As an album cover I question the use of the black borders containing nothing. It looks as if almost 1/2 of the available space has been wasted. It might have been better to crop off some of the sides of the picture than to try to create a square with blank filler. The choice might have been justified had there been something placed in the blank portions. Unfortunately, the presentation has to fit within the rules and stand on it''s own within the challenge.', '2004-07-30 13:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(833399, 93526, 11800, '<td valign="top">The cover is well thought out. Good job.</td>', 'The cover is well thought out. Good job.', '2004-07-30 13:04:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(833421, 93303, 15642, '<td valign="top">well done</td>', 'well done', '2004-07-30 13:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(833422, 93595, 15642, '<td valign="top">nice shot-i''d reconsider the font choice<br/></td>', 'nice shot-i''d reconsider the font choice', '2004-07-30 13:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(833423, 93099, 15642, '<td valign="top">''saddness''?</td>', '''saddness''?', '2004-07-30 13:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
