(833429, 93420, 11800, '<td valign="top">Seems that the food and water dishes are untouched. Perhaps it is a case of dumb pet-owner (is) clueless? lol<br/>As far as the picture is concerned, I really like the sharp shadow and clarity. I''m somewhat put off by the highlights but it seems that the photographer used a small apeture to try and reduce the glare so I have to assume that they were done that way on purpose.</td>', 'Seems that the food and water dishes are untouched. Perhaps it is a case of dumb pet-owner (is) clueless? lolAs far as the picture is concerned, I really like the sharp shadow and clarity. I''m somewhat put off by the highlights but it seems that the photographer used a small apeture to try and reduce the glare so I have to assume that they were done that way on purpose.', '2004-07-30 13:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(833454, 93429, 11800, '<td valign="top">The title and picture, imo, should go together in this challenge. The picture is pretty and well shot but the title doesn''t go with it. The title makes me want to see the people that are the subject of the title and not just one person but a whole clan. <br/>Deserted painted cliffs describes it much better but that is just my opinion.</td>', 'The title and picture, imo, should go together in this challenge. The picture is pretty and well shot but the title doesn''t go with it. The title makes me want to see the people that are the subject of the title and not just one person but a whole clan. Deserted painted cliffs describes it much better but that is just my opinion.', '2004-07-30 13:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(833504, 93589, 11800, '<td valign="top">I like how the composition works on this one. Nothing is quite centered or on the thirds so it creates an unbalanced tension and the man is placed in a box which adds to the feeling. It''s just a shame that it looks overexposed on my monitor. That could work if you were allowed to add different layers to the composition, but for here I would like to see more details. I like the addition of "exile".</td>', 'I like how the composition works on this one. Nothing is quite centered or on the thirds so it creates an unbalanced tension and the man is placed in a box which adds to the feeling. It''s just a shame that it looks overexposed on my monitor. That could work if you were allowed to add different layers to the composition, but for here I would like to see more details. I like the addition of "exile".', '2004-07-30 14:03:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(833530, 93429, 17033, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, well done...a few comments: not sure the vertical album title works, rock colour might have looked better a bit redder to contrast with the sky, I think NeatImage has been used....taken too much of the rock detail away.</td>', 'Nice composition, well done...a few comments: not sure the vertical album title works, rock colour might have looked better a bit redder to contrast with the sky, I think NeatImage has been used....taken too much of the rock detail away.', '2004-07-30 14:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(833537, 93443, 17033, '<td valign="top">really like the overall red hue and lettering. I think a higher point of view would have worked better...the table is too prominent at the bottom (but I guess you were taking a candid photo and wanted to stay incognito). Also the motion blurring is a bit distracting</td>', 'really like the overall red hue and lettering. I think a higher point of view would have worked better...the table is too prominent at the bottom (but I guess you were taking a candid photo and wanted to stay incognito). Also the motion blurring is a bit distracting', '2004-07-30 14:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
