(833723, 93440, 6130, '<td valign="top">Great 10</td>', 'Great 10', '2004-07-30 17:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(833724, 93573, 6130, '<td valign="top">Nice and I like it.</td>', 'Nice and I like it.', '2004-07-30 17:49:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(833746, 93598, 509, '<td valign="top">Imho, this is a little too busy for an album cover.  I think that with a slower hand movement and/or less times covering up the lens (depending on what technique was used), this would be improved.  That way, there would be only a few of the hand "ghosts."  With that, I think this would be a great shot.  As it is now, it is still nicely done, just a little busy.</td>', 'Imho, this is a little too busy for an album cover.  I think that with a slower hand movement and/or less times covering up the lens (depending on what technique was used), this would be improved.  That way, there would be only a few of the hand "ghosts."  With that, I think this would be a great shot.  As it is now, it is still nicely done, just a little busy.', '2004-07-30 18:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(833748, 92846, 509, '<td valign="top">As impressive as the lightning capture is, I would prefer a different composition.  If you had the pixels to work with, maybe having the lightning biased slightly to one side of the frame, or rotating the canvas to give a different angle for the bolt.  The centered composition doesn''t work here imho.  Great capture though.</td>', 'As impressive as the lightning capture is, I would prefer a different composition.  If you had the pixels to work with, maybe having the lightning biased slightly to one side of the frame, or rotating the canvas to give a different angle for the bolt.  The centered composition doesn''t work here imho.  Great capture though.', '2004-07-30 18:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(833750, 93153, 509, '<td valign="top">This looks very compressed to me.  The picture can be 150 kb max, but this is less than 80 kb.  It detracts somewhat from your presentation.  The composition here is good, but the frame is unnecessary in my opinion.  Not sure about the font (both the style and color) either.</td>', 'This looks very compressed to me.  The picture can be 150 kb max, but this is less than 80 kb.  It detracts somewhat from your presentation.  The composition here is good, but the frame is unnecessary in my opinion.  Not sure about the font (both the style and color) either.', '2004-07-30 18:18:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(833754, 93303, 509, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what that is, but I love the creativity.  The subtle text around the drain works very well, but might be a bit too subtle.  The only technical issue I have is a little softness at the bottom right and top left of the drain (maybe a smaller aperture to bring them in closer focus), but other than that, this is a nice shot.</td>', 'I don''t know what that is, but I love the creativity.  The subtle text around the drain works very well, but might be a bit too subtle.  The only technical issue I have is a little softness at the bottom right and top left of the drain (maybe a smaller aperture to bring them in closer focus), but other than that, this is a nice shot.', '2004-07-30 18:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(833755, 93021, 509, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  One of my favorites this round.  Creative use of the DPC abbreviation as well = )</td>', 'Great shot.  One of my favorites this round.  Creative use of the DPC abbreviation as well = )', '2004-07-30 18:20:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(833756, 93155, 509, '<td valign="top">Since the band name begins with "distant", a wider angle of view would help this (depending on what is outside of the frame i guess).  I''d like to see the dock much smaller in the background, to go with your title.</td>', 'Since the band name begins with "distant", a wider angle of view would help this (depending on what is outside of the frame i guess).  I''d like to see the dock much smaller in the background, to go with your title.', '2004-07-30 18:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(833767, 93169, 509, '<td valign="top">To give the viewer a clear point to focus, maybe desaturate all but the darker orange piller.  This would add to the depth of the shot imho.</td>', 'To give the viewer a clear point to focus, maybe desaturate all but the darker orange piller.  This would add to the depth of the shot imho.', '2004-07-30 18:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(833771, 93461, 509, '<td valign="top">Honestly, I don''t think I would see this as an album cover.  For another challenge, this might work better.</td>', 'Honestly, I don''t think I would see this as an album cover.  For another challenge, this might work better.', '2004-07-30 18:33:36.000000', NULL, 1),
