(834123, 93210, 8624, '<td valign="top">10 for the photo from me. I love the expression and the grime and the fabric and everything. I think the "Demerging Personality Conflict" is a weak take on the DPC acronym, but I like the text treatment and, as mentioned, the photo stands on its own. my favorite in the challenge!</td>', '10 for the photo from me. I love the expression and the grime and the fabric and everything. I think the "Demerging Personality Conflict" is a weak take on the DPC acronym, but I like the text treatment and, as mentioned, the photo stands on its own. my favorite in the challenge!', '2004-07-31 00:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(834134, 93417, 20613, '<td valign="top">This is a hilarious shot that has captured emotion on an amazing level!  Great job!</td>', 'This is a hilarious shot that has captured emotion on an amazing level!  Great job!', '2004-07-31 01:08:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(834135, 93269, 20613, '<td valign="top">I laughed.  Hard.</td>', 'I laughed.  Hard.', '2004-07-31 01:08:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(834277, 93556, 5822, '<td valign="top">Clarity and focus are really sharp. I find the two leaves in front of the pigeon distracting, though, and think you should have cloned them out.  Your title is more appropo for the album name than the name of the group, I think.</td>', 'Clarity and focus are really sharp. I find the two leaves in front of the pigeon distracting, though, and think you should have cloned them out.  Your title is more appropo for the album name than the name of the group, I think.', '2004-07-31 06:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(834281, 93474, 5822, '<td valign="top">Funny picture and title, but the surroundings of this image show more of a contemporary home than the psychedelic 60''s image that I think you were trying to portray, and this, imo, weakens the message of the album cover.  While all the clutter of the forground help to give the impression of "deranged," I find it to be visually difficult to look at and the 60''s generation woudl not have aligned themselves with Coka-Cola.  Lighting is good, but a bit harsh.</td>', 'Funny picture and title, but the surroundings of this image show more of a contemporary home than the psychedelic 60''s image that I think you were trying to portray, and this, imo, weakens the message of the album cover.  While all the clutter of the forground help to give the impression of "deranged," I find it to be visually difficult to look at and the 60''s generation woudl not have aligned themselves with Coka-Cola.  Lighting is good, but a bit harsh.', '2004-07-31 06:20:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(834282, 93155, 5822, '<td valign="top">Wonderful crisp image with good saturated color. I think you should have tried to isolate the sailboats more as they get lost in the background building. Either a different point of view to isolate them, or zoom in for a close up.</td>', 'Wonderful crisp image with good saturated color. I think you should have tried to isolate the sailboats more as they get lost in the background building. Either a different point of view to isolate them, or zoom in for a close up.', '2004-07-31 06:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(834285, 92544, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like the title and the white lettering. Image gives somewhat of eerie feeling with the harsh lighting.  The three tombstones also seem to contribute to this and seem to convey some sort of meaning. Ordinarily, I would say that technically the too well defined shadow that goes accross the image and subject (tombstones) would be a detraction, but in this case, I think it''s appropriate and also adds to the general feeling of today''s groups.  Didn''t like this when I first saw it, but after looking at it for a while I think it''s a good effort.</td>', 'I like the title and the white lettering. Image gives somewhat of eerie feeling with the harsh lighting.  The three tombstones also seem to contribute to this and seem to convey some sort of meaning. Ordinarily, I would say that technically the too well defined shadow that goes accross the image and subject (tombstones) would be a detraction, but in this case, I think it''s appropriate and also adds to the general feeling of today''s groups.  Didn''t like this when I first saw it, but after looking at it for a while I think it''s a good effort.', '2004-07-31 06:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(834288, 92928, 5822, '<td valign="top">Love this image and can see it, and your arrangement of the lettering as an album cover.  The strong diagnol lines that these dancers create really make for a feeling of energy and action, as do the black colored clothing they are wearing, which also make them look heavy (not in their bodies, but in their dance steps). Background is wonderful too as it''s simple and non-distracting and shows a unique place for this activity to take place giving the impression of originality to this group. Good job!</td>', 'Love this image and can see it, and your arrangement of the lettering as an album cover.  The strong diagnol lines that these dancers create really make for a feeling of energy and action, as do the black colored clothing they are wearing, which also make them look heavy (not in their bodies, but in their dance steps). Background is wonderful too as it''s simple and non-distracting and shows a unique place for this activity to take place giving the impression of originality to this group. Good job!', '2004-07-31 06:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(834291, 93602, 5822, '<td valign="top">Even though this appears to be more of a solo act and the image is not presented in album cover format, I think you did a very good job with both picture and title, although the lettering font could be changed, imo.  I love how her red hair  contrasts with the black. Technically a very good picture.</td>', 'Even though this appears to be more of a solo act and the image is not presented in album cover format, I think you did a very good job with both picture and title, although the lettering font could be changed, imo.  I love how her red hair  contrasts with the black. Technically a very good picture.', '2004-07-31 06:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(834292, 93334, 5822, '<td valign="top">lol..Love it! Very funny, especially the elepahnt piggy bank.  I like the lettering and the way you''ve isolated just the hands/arms and the piggy bank. Definitely looks like an album cover. The only criticism I have is that it appears to have lost too much detail in the skin from too much noise reduction? Good job, nontheless.</td>', 'lol..Love it! Very funny, especially the elepahnt piggy bank.  I like the lettering and the way you''ve isolated just the hands/arms and the piggy bank. Definitely looks like an album cover. The only criticism I have is that it appears to have lost too much detail in the skin from too much noise reduction? Good job, nontheless.', '2004-07-31 06:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
