(835320, 93588, 20613, '<td valign="top">Hahaha, this is one of the funniest ones I have seen!!!  Great job! :)</td>', 'Hahaha, this is one of the funniest ones I have seen!!!  Great job! :)', '2004-08-01 12:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(835323, 92937, 20613, '<td valign="top">It''s funny, because I would definitely consider this one of the "fun" challenges, where all the photos don''t necessarily have to be great, but they must fit the challenge and be decent photographs.  Most of the photos in this challenge seem pretty mediocre, because they''re comical photos.  Anyway, what I am TRYING to say here is that this is a genuinly good photograph; I could definitely see this on an album.  Great job!  This will probably be my only 10 for the challenge.</td>', 'It''s funny, because I would definitely consider this one of the "fun" challenges, where all the photos don''t necessarily have to be great, but they must fit the challenge and be decent photographs.  Most of the photos in this challenge seem pretty mediocre, because they''re comical photos.  Anyway, what I am TRYING to say here is that this is a genuinly good photograph; I could definitely see this on an album.  Great job!  This will probably be my only 10 for the challenge.', '2004-08-01 12:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(835328, 93444, 20613, '<td valign="top">This is a really funny and great shot!!  Amazing job; It''s awesome that you could even catch that on your camera.  9 :)</td>', 'This is a really funny and great shot!!  Amazing job; It''s awesome that you could even catch that on your camera.  9 :)', '2004-08-01 12:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(835330, 93558, 20613, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  The sky looks amazing.</td>', 'Great shot!  The sky looks amazing.', '2004-08-01 12:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(835332, 92915, 20613, '<td valign="top">I love this!!  The name that you chose is really cute, too :)  Also, this is an amazing shot.</td>', 'I love this!!  The name that you chose is really cute, too :)  Also, this is an amazing shot.', '2004-08-01 12:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(835334, 92897, 20613, '<td valign="top">:)  this one is hilarious.  "prey" for me hahah :)  I''m sorry, I''m really easily amused.  I love this entry because it''s such a great shot &amp; it''s hilarious.  great job!</td>', ':)  this one is hilarious.  "prey" for me hahah :)  I''m sorry, I''m really easily amused.  I love this entry because it''s such a great shot & it''s hilarious.  great job!', '2004-08-01 12:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
