(835442, 93468, 14614, '<td valign="top">One of my ribbon picks -- you got this just right (composition, b&amp;w, title, text) well done.</td>', 'One of my ribbon picks -- you got this just right (composition, b&w, title, text) well done.', '2004-08-01 14:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(835446, 92563, 14614, '<td valign="top">One of my ribbon picks (I like everything about this except the font for the band''s title -- clever picture is just icing on the cake)  I can see this as an album cover.  Well done</td>', 'One of my ribbon picks (I like everything about this except the font for the band''s title -- clever picture is just icing on the cake)  I can see this as an album cover.  Well done', '2004-08-01 14:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(835449, 92937, 14614, '<td valign="top">One of the best this challenge, lighting and placement of text is superb</td>', 'One of the best this challenge, lighting and placement of text is superb', '2004-08-01 14:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(835451, 93208, 14614, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites this challenge - photograph is eye catching.</td>', 'One of my favorites this challenge - photograph is eye catching.', '2004-08-01 14:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(835452, 93603, 14614, '<td valign="top">I like the blurring behind the text and the photo goes great - one of the best this challenge</td>', 'I like the blurring behind the text and the photo goes great - one of the best this challenge', '2004-08-01 14:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(835453, 93610, 14614, '<td valign="top">wonderful macro, nicely lit, excellent compostion - one of the best this challenge</td>', 'wonderful macro, nicely lit, excellent compostion - one of the best this challenge', '2004-08-01 14:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(835455, 93529, 14614, '<td valign="top">The expression on each model is too good.  The font works - phrasing of the band name''s a bit awkward -- still one of my top picks this challenge -- good luck</td>', 'The expression on each model is too good.  The font works - phrasing of the band name''s a bit awkward -- still one of my top picks this challenge -- good luck', '2004-08-01 14:41:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(835456, 93459, 14614, '<td valign="top">This is so well done - the band title works, simple photo highlights the band (as it should) the "R" is a creative touch, text font and placement excellent.  One of my ribbon picks</td>', 'This is so well done - the band title works, simple photo highlights the band (as it should) the "R" is a creative touch, text font and placement excellent.  One of my ribbon picks', '2004-08-01 14:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(835458, 93210, 14614, '<td valign="top">Your model got the expression just right - I can see it being used to advertise the band.  I like the font and placement. One of the best this challenge</td>', 'Your model got the expression just right - I can see it being used to advertise the band.  I like the font and placement. One of the best this challenge', '2004-08-01 14:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(835461, 93576, 14614, '<td valign="top">The elements came together just right in your composition - text and font perfect, retro phone works -- one of the best this challenge.</td>', 'The elements came together just right in your composition - text and font perfect, retro phone works -- one of the best this challenge.', '2004-08-01 14:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(835474, 93573, 24926, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image, great detail, the eye looks striking and I love the contrast.</td>', 'Beautiful image, great detail, the eye looks striking and I love the contrast.', '2004-08-01 15:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(835476, 93106, 24926, '<td valign="top">Great idea and great image!</td>', 'Great idea and great image!', '2004-08-01 15:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(835477, 93553, 4007, '<td valign="top">The band name is believable and pretty likable.  The photo is wonderful.  Colors, idea, and composition are all excellent.  Nice work.</td>', 'The band name is believable and pretty likable.  The photo is wonderful.  Colors, idea, and composition are all excellent.  Nice work.', '2004-08-01 15:29:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(835480, 92760, 4007, '<td valign="top">The shot doesn''t seem quite "polished" enough for me to picture it on an actual album cover, but it''s a great location idea for a shot, and executed pretty well on the whole.  I''m not sure if your models were voluntary or candidly captured, but their posing might have been improved.  Also a little more depth of field might have helped put them into better focus without giving up the focus on the reflective dome.  Anyway, cool concept.  Nice work.</td>', 'The shot doesn''t seem quite "polished" enough for me to picture it on an actual album cover, but it''s a great location idea for a shot, and executed pretty well on the whole.  I''m not sure if your models were voluntary or candidly captured, but their posing might have been improved.  Also a little more depth of field might have helped put them into better focus without giving up the focus on the reflective dome.  Anyway, cool concept.  Nice work.', '2004-08-01 15:32:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(835482, 93569, 4007, '<td valign="top">The band name doesn''t appeal to me much, but the photo has a great quirky feel to it, and I think you chose text that worked well with that.</td>', 'The band name doesn''t appeal to me much, but the photo has a great quirky feel to it, and I think you chose text that worked well with that.', '2004-08-01 15:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(835501, 93580, 16046, '<td valign="top">clever, well done</td>', 'clever, well done', '2004-08-01 16:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(835503, 93210, 16046, '<td valign="top">awesome job</td>', 'awesome job', '2004-08-01 16:20:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(835504, 92861, 16046, '<td valign="top">great work</td>', 'great work', '2004-08-01 16:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(835505, 93602, 16046, '<td valign="top">wow, very cool</td>', 'wow, very cool', '2004-08-01 16:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(835506, 93610, 16046, '<td valign="top">well done</td>', 'well done', '2004-08-01 16:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(835507, 93603, 16046, '<td valign="top">nice color, well done</td>', 'nice color, well done', '2004-08-01 16:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(835538, 93155, 9668, '<td valign="top">Well done, creative. Text works well, nice composition</td>', 'Well done, creative. Text works well, nice composition', '2004-08-01 17:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(835539, 92617, 4007, '<td valign="top">The desaturated foreground with just a hint of color showing in the background was an excellent choice here.  The effect works great.  In fact, the sharp close up foreground with the blurred player in the background works well too.  I''m not sure the text matches the tone of the shot though.</td>', 'The desaturated foreground with just a hint of color showing in the background was an excellent choice here.  The effect works great.  In fact, the sharp close up foreground with the blurred player in the background works well too.  I''m not sure the text matches the tone of the shot though.', '2004-08-01 17:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(835542, 92965, 9668, '<td valign="top">Image is a bit small, it is differnt then normal, but I don''t think I would actually see this on an album cover. I like that you listed the feature songs.</td>', 'Image is a bit small, it is differnt then normal, but I don''t think I would actually see this on an album cover. I like that you listed the feature songs.', '2004-08-01 17:10:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(835545, 93598, 4007, '<td valign="top">I like your idea here but for some reason the result rubs me the wrong way.  I''m not exactly sure what it is though.  I think maybe the multiple hand captures don''t really seem to convey a sense of motion to me as much as a bunch of hands being held still at different heights.  Maybe just having fewer hand captures, say three, that were a little more spread out and not overlapping as much would make me like it more.  Anyway, a great idea and I certainly wouldn''t say the execution is bad on it either, I just get the feeling that I could be drawn into this so much more than I am.  Sorry I can''t quite put my finger on how though.</td>', 'I like your idea here but for some reason the result rubs me the wrong way.  I''m not exactly sure what it is though.  I think maybe the multiple hand captures don''t really seem to convey a sense of motion to me as much as a bunch of hands being held still at different heights.  Maybe just having fewer hand captures, say three, that were a little more spread out and not overlapping as much would make me like it more.  Anyway, a great idea and I certainly wouldn''t say the execution is bad on it either, I just get the feeling that I could be drawn into this so much more than I am.  Sorry I can''t quite put my finger on how though.', '2004-08-01 17:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(835548, 92563, 4007, '<td valign="top">I love the idea here.  One of the most creative concepts in the challenge.  The shots is crisp and professional looking as well.  The band name might be a little bit of a stretch, but a lot of real band names are pretty bizarre, so I could imagine it being real.  Great work.</td>', 'I love the idea here.  One of the most creative concepts in the challenge.  The shots is crisp and professional looking as well.  The band name might be a little bit of a stretch, but a lot of real band names are pretty bizarre, so I could imagine it being real.  Great work.', '2004-08-01 17:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(835553, 93580, 4007, '<td valign="top">This shot is awesome.. a rare instance where the effect used really improved the shot and doesn''t come out looking cheesy.  The composition and feeling of depth is impressive as well.  However, in my opinion the band name is downright horrid.  Certainly seems like an attempt to fit the shot into the challenge.  (The lousy pun hit single also would have been better left out.)  Regardless of that, this was a pretty open challenge so I''m more interested in the photo than the rest, and the photo is great.</td>', 'This shot is awesome.. a rare instance where the effect used really improved the shot and doesn''t come out looking cheesy.  The composition and feeling of depth is impressive as well.  However, in my opinion the band name is downright horrid.  Certainly seems like an attempt to fit the shot into the challenge.  (The lousy pun hit single also would have been better left out.)  Regardless of that, this was a pretty open challenge so I''m more interested in the photo than the rest, and the photo is great.', '2004-08-01 17:19:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(835628, 93591, 1031, '<td valign="top">Dolphins are always popular!</td>', 'Dolphins are always popular!', '2004-08-01 19:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
