(836480, 93210, 5728, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for your comments and nice words. I forgot how much fun this can be :) In photoshop I used calculations on this. I multiplied one blue channel into another blue channel and fine tuned the settings to bring out a deep contrast and full tonal range.</td>', 'Thank you all for your comments and nice words. I forgot how much fun this can be :) In photoshop I used calculations on this. I multiplied one blue channel into another blue channel and fine tuned the settings to bring out a deep contrast and full tonal range.', '2004-08-02 03:37:14.000000', NULL, 0),
