(836661, 93210, 11078, '<td valign="top">Hi Gary! Congratulations on ''Another'' Blue Ribbon <br/> <br/> Nice to see you back and I see you haven''t lost your touch.<br/> <br/>I cant say if I saw this image on a C D that it would invite me to buy it but as usual a brilliant shot and I can only stand in awe.<br/> I just seem to be getting worse and I really am trying.<br/> <br/>Nice detail and great image <br/></td>', 'Hi Gary! Congratulations on ''Another'' Blue Ribbon   Nice to see you back and I see you haven''t lost your touch. I cant say if I saw this image on a C D that it would invite me to buy it but as usual a brilliant shot and I can only stand in awe. I just seem to be getting worse and I really am trying. Nice detail and great image ', '2004-08-02 07:12:27.000000', NULL, 0),
