(837921, 93303, 3102, '<td valign="top">Even more impressive after reading the description!  I assumed this was some sort of toy -- it''s all the better knowing that you concocted this guy yourself!</td>', 'Even more impressive after reading the description!  I assumed this was some sort of toy -- it''s all the better knowing that you concocted this guy yourself!', '2004-08-02 19:35:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(838049, 93590, 16790, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the comments.  The text was actually anti-aliased, I just forgot to remove my old white text layer from beneath the red, giving it some jaggedy-looking glowing edges; I run in 1280x1024, so I didn''t notice until it was too late.  Oh well :)</td>', 'Thanks for all the comments.  The text was actually anti-aliased, I just forgot to remove my old white text layer from beneath the red, giving it some jaggedy-looking glowing edges; I run in 1280x1024, so I didn''t notice until it was too late.  Oh well :)', '2004-08-02 20:41:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(838159, 93210, 7706, '<td valign="top">*shakes head* You have to be getting sick of all of the ribbons by now lol Your walls must be covered in them lol<br/> <br/>Congrats though.<br/> <br/>How long did it take the model to get cleaned up after that? It looks very messy lol</td>', '*shakes head* You have to be getting sick of all of the ribbons by now lol Your walls must be covered in them lol Congrats though. How long did it take the model to get cleaned up after that? It looks very messy lol', '2004-08-02 21:32:01.000000', NULL, 0);
