(840097, 93202, 17134, '<td valign="top">The stoplight is really necessary in my opinion.. it takes the ''armageddon-feel'' of the picture closer to your own home because of it.. thus making it (a lot!) stronger.<br/> <br/>Use of text would (indeed) have made it an even better album cover (wich was the general idea ;)) so i rated it 9 and am very suprised to see this end so low! Shame on those 143 voters that rated this below a 6..</td>', 'The stoplight is really necessary in my opinion.. it takes the ''armageddon-feel'' of the picture closer to your own home because of it.. thus making it (a lot!) stronger. Use of text would (indeed) have made it an even better album cover (wich was the general idea ;)) so i rated it 9 and am very suprised to see this end so low! Shame on those 143 voters that rated this below a 6..', '2004-08-03 19:06:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(840539, 93210, 4494, '<td valign="top">You da man!  Awesome shot, again.  Didn''t have time to vote in this one but I browsed and noticed a lot of good, creative shots, so congrats on the win!</td>', 'You da man!  Awesome shot, again.  Didn''t have time to vote in this one but I browsed and noticed a lot of good, creative shots, so congrats on the win!', '2004-08-03 23:23:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(840733, 93433, 554, '<td valign="top">This should have placed much much higher. Well done. Interesting and well placed props. Good focus. Parts of the hat seem too dark but with the comment of shot being too light, it must be my monitor. However the hand is almost too light.  Nice shot.</td>', 'This should have placed much much higher. Well done. Interesting and well placed props. Good focus. Parts of the hat seem too dark but with the comment of shot being too light, it must be my monitor. However the hand is almost too light.  Nice shot.', '2004-08-04 00:43:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(841306, 93576, 11078, '<td valign="top">Hello Melissa from the  Critique Club <br/> <br/>You say you were desperate but you have done a lovely job on this.<br/>It shows a lot of thought. (Your mother is a very beautiful lady. What georgous eyes she has!) and yes, your Dad is very handsome also<br/>I like the feel of this and looking at your comments I am not the only one.<br/>The text looks alright to me it almost looks like embroidery which adds to the old sort of look<br/>I am not very technical and I agree with you that photographs are very hard to photograph but you have done an excellent job with this <br/>Your score is a very decent one and I myself think it should be higher<br/>There were a lot of excellent entries, and this is up there with the best IMHO.  The only small picky bit would be the little bit of harsh light middle top.<br/>Keep enjoying your photography<br/>Good luck in future Challenges <br/>If you have any questions please feel free to PM me<br/>Regards<br/>Sally  <br/></td>', 'Hello Melissa from the  Critique Club  You say you were desperate but you have done a lovely job on this.It shows a lot of thought. (Your mother is a very beautiful lady. What georgous eyes she has!) and yes, your Dad is very handsome alsoI like the feel of this and looking at your comments I am not the only one.The text looks alright to me it almost looks like embroidery which adds to the old sort of lookI am not very technical and I agree with you that photographs are very hard to photograph but you have done an excellent job with this Your score is a very decent one and I myself think it should be higherThere were a lot of excellent entries, and this is up there with the best IMHO.  The only small picky bit would be the little bit of harsh light middle top.Keep enjoying your photographyGood luck in future Challenges If you have any questions please feel free to PM meRegardsSally  ', '2004-08-04 03:45:26.000000', NULL, 0),
