(843492, 93335, 11078, '<td valign="top">Hello Thomas from the Critique Club<br/> <br/>I think the reason you were voted down in this challenge was the fact that this is an image of a Deer not a Caribou and even though there is a similarity, people tend to get a bit picky.<br/> <br/>The image itself is very nice, but seems a bit over exposed in the foreground  and the deer a little on the pink side maybe the tonal values could be turned down to bring up the fore ground <br/>The wording looks like a typical wording from a computer programme and not very inventive although the words themselves are good ( the Title)<br/>I like them myself but voters get really technical here on D P C (I find)<br/> <br/>There were a lot of very clever and impressive entries in this challenge so I think voters were really looking for perfection<br/>Your image itself is very nice. Good focus and detail with the animal looking straight at you   How did you get so close? <br/>So I cannot offer any more help to improve your image so enjoy your photography and Good luck in the future challenges <br/>If you have any questions please feel free to P M me <br/>Regards<br/>Sally</td>', 'Hello Thomas from the Critique Club I think the reason you were voted down in this challenge was the fact that this is an image of a Deer not a Caribou and even though there is a similarity, people tend to get a bit picky. The image itself is very nice, but seems a bit over exposed in the foreground  and the deer a little on the pink side maybe the tonal values could be turned down to bring up the fore ground The wording looks like a typical wording from a computer programme and not very inventive although the words themselves are good ( the Title)I like them myself but voters get really technical here on D P C (I find) There were a lot of very clever and impressive entries in this challenge so I think voters were really looking for perfectionYour image itself is very nice. Good focus and detail with the animal looking straight at you   How did you get so close? So I cannot offer any more help to improve your image so enjoy your photography and Good luck in the future challenges If you have any questions please feel free to P M me RegardsSally', '2004-08-04 23:31:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(843494, 93303, 20608, '<td valign="top">I have to veiw this picture everyday because my 2 year old daughter REALLY LOVES IT.. I like it but she has gone digital over it and always insists that I stop what I am doing and let her see your picture.. so I guess I should say a big THANK YOU for making my little girl so happy.. There is a picture of her on my profile, she looks so sweet but she is really a boy in a girls body... she likes cars, cameras, breaking things, and is VERY loud... anyway... congrats on the ribbon well deserved</td>', 'I have to veiw this picture everyday because my 2 year old daughter REALLY LOVES IT.. I like it but she has gone digital over it and always insists that I stop what I am doing and let her see your picture.. so I guess I should say a big THANK YOU for making my little girl so happy.. There is a picture of her on my profile, she looks so sweet but she is really a boy in a girls body... she likes cars, cameras, breaking things, and is VERY loud... anyway... congrats on the ribbon well deserved', '2004-08-04 23:31:57.000000', NULL, 0),
