(1347376, 93210, 17126, '<td valign="top">I agree with you... Sometimes it happens that way with art, ya know? You come back later and realize the mistakes; even if the finished product looks incredible, it can still be better.<br/> <br/>That''s the nature of photography and art in general, don''t you think?<br/> <br/>I guess that''s why no picture will ever satisfy me as being the best; satisfaction is never within reach for the whole of photography, because that will mean the death of future creativity.</td>', 'I agree with you... Sometimes it happens that way with art, ya know? You come back later and realize the mistakes; even if the finished product looks incredible, it can still be better. That''s the nature of photography and art in general, don''t you think? I guess that''s why no picture will ever satisfy me as being the best; satisfaction is never within reach for the whole of photography, because that will mean the death of future creativity.', '2005-04-30 18:38:59.000000', NULL, 0),
